Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.80,0:00:52.67,ENG,1,0,0,0,,"Once upon a time there was a lovely princess
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.74,0:00:56.50,ENG,2,0,0,0,,"But she had an enchantment upon her of a fearful sort...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.58,0:01:01.48,ENG,3,0,0,0,,"which could only be broken by love's first kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.55,0:01:03.91,ENG,4,0,0,0,,"She was locked away in a castle...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.98,0:01:08.18,ENG,5,0,0,0,,"guarded by a terrible fire-breathing dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.25,0:01:12.66,ENG,6,0,0,0,,"Many brave knights had attempted to free her from this deadful prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.73,0:01:15.49,ENG,7,0,0,0,,"but none prevailed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.56,0:01:17.76,ENG,8,0,0,0,,"She waited in the dragon's keep...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.83,0:01:20.77,ENG,9,0,0,0,,"in the highest room of the tallest tower...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.83,0:01:25.36,ENG,10,0,0,0,,for her true love and true love's first kiss. "
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.44,0:01:28.43,ENG,11,0,0,0,,Like that's ever gonna happen
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.44,0:01:53.43,ENG,12,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.47,0:03:40.73,ENG,13,0,0,0,,- Think it's in there? - All right. Let's get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.81,0:03:43.57,ENG,14,0,0,0,,Whoa, Hold on. Do you know what thing can do to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.64,0:03:46.61,ENG,15,0,0,0,,Yeah, it'll grind your bones for its bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.68,0:03:50.64,ENG,16,0,0,0,,Yes, well, actually, that would be a giant.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.72,0:03:54.78,ENG,17,0,0,0,,Now, ogres...  They're much worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.85,0:03:57.75,ENG,18,0,0,0,,They'll make a suit from your freshly peeled skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.86,0:03:59.95,ENG,19,0,0,0,,They'll shave your liver.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.03,0:04:03.29,ENG,20,0,0,0,,Squeeze the jelly from your eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.36,0:04:05.92,ENG,21,0,0,0,,- Actualy, it's quite good on toast. - Back! Back, beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.00,0:04:08.09,ENG,22,0,0,0,,Back! I warn ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.25,0:04:33.82,ENG,23,0,0,0,,This is the part where you run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.60,0:04:43.63,ENG,24,0,0,0,,And stay out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.54,0:04:48.60,ENG,25,0,0,0,,"Wanted. Fairy tale creatures. "
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.05,0:04:56.45,ENG,26,0,0,0,,All right. This one's full
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.65,0:04:59.21,ENG,27,0,0,0,,Take it away!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.28,0:05:03.19,ENG,28,0,0,0,,- Move it along. Come on! Get up! - Next!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.26,0:05:06.19,ENG,29,0,0,0,,Give me that! Your flying days are over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.26,0:05:08.89,ENG,30,0,0,0,,That's 20 pieces of silver for the witch. Next!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.96,0:05:11.69,ENG,31,0,0,0,,Get up! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.23,0:05:16.72,ENG,32,0,0,0,,Keep quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.80,0:05:19.70,ENG,33,0,0,0,,This cage is too small.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.77,0:05:21.86,ENG,34,0,0,0,,Please don't turn me in. I'll never be stubborn again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.94,0:05:23.93,ENG,35,0,0,0,,I can change. Please! Give ma another chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.01,0:05:26.41,ENG,36,0,0,0,,Oh, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.48,0:05:29.38,ENG,37,0,0,0,,- Next! What have you got? - This little wooden puppet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.45,0:05:34.39,ENG,38,0,0,0,,I'm not a puppet. I'm a real boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.45,0:05:36.82,ENG,39,0,0,0,,Five shillings forthe possessed toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.92,0:05:39.02,ENG,40,0,0,0,,Take it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.09,0:05:40.99,ENG,41,0,0,0,,Next. What have you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.09,0:05:43.72,ENG,42,0,0,0,,Well, I've got a talking donkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.80,0:05:48.32,ENG,43,0,0,0,,Right. Well, that's good for ten shillings, if you can prouve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.43,0:05:52.37,ENG,44,0,0,0,,Oh, go ahead, little fella.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.44,0:05:57.14,ENG,45,0,0,0,,Oh, oh, he's just...  He's just a little nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.21,0:06:01.20,ENG,46,0,0,0,,He's really quite a chatterbox. Talk, you boneheaded dolt...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.28,0:06:03.87,ENG,47,0,0,0,,- That's it. I've heard enough. Guards! - No, no, he talks!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.95,0:06:08.08,ENG,48,0,0,0,,He does. I can talk. I love to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.15,0:06:11.09,ENG,49,0,0,0,,I'm the talkingest damn thing you ever saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.16,0:06:13.72,ENG,50,0,0,0,,- Get her out of my sight. - No, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.79,0:06:18.23,ENG,51,0,0,0,,I swear! Oh! He can talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.53,0:06:22.93,ENG,52,0,0,0,,Hey! I can fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.00,0:06:24.63,ENG,53,0,0,0,,- He can fly! - He can fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.70,0:06:27.76,ENG,54,0,0,0,,He can talk! Ha, ha! That's right, fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.84,0:06:30.10,ENG,55,0,0,0,,Now I'm a flying, talking donkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.18,0:06:32.80,ENG,56,0,0,0,,Your right have seen a house fly maybe even a super fly,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.88,0:06:35.94,ENG,57,0,0,0,,but I bet you ain't never seen a donkey fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.32,0:06:44.26,ENG,58,0,0,0,,Seize him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.90,0:07:00.10,ENG,59,0,0,0,,After him! He's getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.34,0:07:07.64,ENG,60,0,0,0,,You there. Ogre!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.71,0:07:10.01,ENG,61,0,0,0,,Aye?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.08,0:07:14.18,ENG,62,0,0,0,,By the order of Lord Farquaad, I am authorized to place you under arrest...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.25,0:07:19.85,ENG,63,0,0,0,,and transport you to a designated... resettlement facility.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.93,0:07:23.95,ENG,64,0,0,0,,Oh, really? You and what army?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.74,0:07:36.73,ENG,65,0,0,0,,Can I say something to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.81,0:07:40.18,ENG,66,0,0,0,,Listen, you was really, really somethin' back there. Incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.25,0:07:46.01,ENG,67,0,0,0,,Are you talking to... me? Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.08,0:07:50.04,ENG,68,0,0,0,,Yes, I was talkin' to you. Can I tell you that you was great back there? Those guards!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.12,0:07:52.85,ENG,69,0,0,0,,They thought they was all of that. Then you showed up, and bam!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.92,0:07:54.89,ENG,70,0,0,0,,They was trippin' over themselves like babes in the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.96,0:07:56.89,ENG,71,0,0,0,,That really made me feel good to see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.96,0:08:00.02,ENG,72,0,0,0,,- Oh, that's great. Really. - Man, it's good to be free.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.10,0:08:05.66,ENG,73,0,0,0,,Now, why don't you go celebrate your freedom with your own friends? Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.74,0:08:09.04,ENG,74,0,0,0,,But, uh, I don't have any friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.11,0:08:11.77,ENG,75,0,0,0,,And I'm not goin' out there by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.84,0:08:14.40,ENG,76,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a minute! I got a great idea! I'll stick with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.48,0:08:16.41,ENG,77,0,0,0,,You're a mean, green, fightin' machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.48,0:08:18.68,ENG,78,0,0,0,,Together we'll scare the spit out of anybody that crosses us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.09,0:08:25.75,ENG,79,0,0,0,,Oh, wow! That was really scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.82,0:08:29.56,ENG,80,0,0,0,,If you don't mind me sayin' if that don't work, your breath certainly will get the job done,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.63,0:08:32.76,ENG,81,0,0,0,,'cause you definitely need some Tic Tacs or something, 'cause your breath stinks!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.83,0:08:36.06,ENG,82,0,0,0,,You almost burned the hair outta my nose,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.13,0:08:38.97,ENG,83,0,0,0,,just like the time...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.04,0:08:42.77,ENG,84,0,0,0,,Then I ate some rotten berries. I had strong gases eking out of my butt that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.84,0:08:45.54,ENG,85,0,0,0,,Why are you following me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.68,0:08:49.24,ENG,86,0,0,0,,I'll tell you why.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.31,0:08:52.25,ENG,87,0,0,0,,'Cause I'm all alone
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.32,0:08:56.08,ENG,88,0,0,0,,There's no one here beside me
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.15,0:08:59.82,ENG,89,0,0,0,,My problems have all gone
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.89,0:09:03.26,ENG,90,0,0,0,,There's no one to deride me
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.33,0:09:05.30,ENG,91,0,0,0,,But you gotta have friend...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.36,0:09:08.42,ENG,92,0,0,0,,Stop singing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.50,0:09:10.56,ENG,93,0,0,0,,It's no wonder you don't have any friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.64,0:09:14.26,ENG,94,0,0,0,,Wow. Only a true friend would be that truly honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.34,0:09:18.40,ENG,95,0,0,0,,Listen, little donkey. Take a look at me. What am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.32,0:09:26.58,ENG,96,0,0,0,,- Really tall? - No! I'm an ogre.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.65,0:09:29.85,ENG,97,0,0,0,,You know. "Grab your torch and pitchforks. "
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.92,0:09:31.95,ENG,98,0,0,0,,Doesn't that bother you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.02,0:09:34.15,ENG,99,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.23,0:09:37.13,ENG,100,0,0,0,,- Really? - Really,really.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.20,0:09:40.32,ENG,101,0,0,0,,Man, I like you. What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.40,0:09:44.10,ENG,102,0,0,0,,Uh, Shrek.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.17,0:09:47.43,ENG,103,0,0,0,,Shrek? Well, you know what I like about you, Shrek?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.51,0:09:50.57,ENG,104,0,0,0,,You got a kind of I don't care what nobody thinks of me thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.61,0:09:54.07,ENG,105,0,0,0,,I like that. I respect that, Shrek. You alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.51,0:09:59.51,ENG,106,0,0,0,,Whoo! Look at that. Who'd want to live in a place like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.58,0:10:02.82,ENG,107,0,0,0,,That would be my home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.89,0:10:05.79,ENG,108,0,0,0,,Oh! And it is lovely! Just beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.86,0:10:09.66,ENG,109,0,0,0,,You are quite a decorator. It's amazing what you've done with such a modest budget.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.73,0:10:14.46,ENG,110,0,0,0,,I like that boulder. That is a nice boulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.24,0:10:20.97,ENG,111,0,0,0,,I guess you don't entertain much, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.04,0:10:22.84,ENG,112,0,0,0,,I like my privacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.91,0:10:25.50,ENG,113,0,0,0,,You know, I do too. That's another thing we have in comon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.58,0:10:27.84,ENG,114,0,0,0,,Like, I hate it when you got somebody in your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.91,0:10:31.82,ENG,115,0,0,0,,You're trying to give them a hint, and they won't leave. There's that awkward silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.95,0:10:37.68,ENG,116,0,0,0,,- Can I stay with you? - Uh, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.76,0:10:40.35,ENG,117,0,0,0,,Can I stay with you, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.43,0:10:42.72,ENG,118,0,0,0,,- Of course! - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.79,0:10:45.19,ENG,119,0,0,0,,- No. - Please! I don't wanna go back there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.26,0:10:49.20,ENG,120,0,0,0,,You don't know what it's like to be considered a freak. Well, maybe you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.27,0:10:51.86,ENG,121,0,0,0,,But that's why we gotta stick together. You gotta let me stay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.94,0:10:55.07,ENG,122,0,0,0,,- Please! Please! - Okay! Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.14,0:10:57.73,ENG,123,0,0,0,,- But one night only. - Ah! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.81,0:11:00.18,ENG,124,0,0,0,,- What are you... No! No! - This is gonna be fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.25,0:11:02.15,ENG,125,0,0,0,,We can stay up late, swappin' manly stories,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.25,0:11:05.05,ENG,126,0,0,0,,and in the mornin' I'm makin' waffles.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.12,0:11:08.38,ENG,127,0,0,0,,Where do, uh, I sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.45,0:11:10.22,ENG,128,0,0,0,,Outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.29,0:11:13.38,ENG,129,0,0,0,,Oh,well, I guess that's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.46,0:11:15.55,ENG,130,0,0,0,,I mean, I don't know you, and you don't know me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.63,0:11:18.03,ENG,131,0,0,0,,so I guess outside is best, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.10,0:11:21.09,ENG,132,0,0,0,,Here I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.27,0:11:27.36,ENG,133,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.44,0:11:31.43,ENG,134,0,0,0,,I mean, I do like the outdoors. I'm a donkey. I was born outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.51,0:11:34.21,ENG,135,0,0,0,,I'll just be sitting by myself outside, I guess, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.28,0:11:36.54,ENG,136,0,0,0,,By myself, outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.65,0:11:41.45,ENG,137,0,0,0,,I'm all alone. There's no one here beside me
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.72,0:12:48.35,ENG,138,0,0,0,,I thought I told you to stay outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.42,0:12:52.12,ENG,139,0,0,0,,I am outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.60,0:13:01.40,ENG,140,0,0,0,,Well, gents, it's a far cry from the farm, but what choice do we have?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.47,0:13:03.99,ENG,141,0,0,0,,It's not home, but it'll do just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.07,0:13:06.00,ENG,142,0,0,0,,What a lovely bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.07,0:13:08.40,ENG,143,0,0,0,,- Got ya. - I found some cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.47,0:13:10.96,ENG,144,0,0,0,,Blah! Awful stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.74,0:13:15.34,ENG,145,0,0,0,,- Is that you, Gorder? - How did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.41,0:13:18.35,ENG,146,0,0,0,,Enough! What are you doing in my house?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.42,0:13:23.05,ENG,147,0,0,0,,Oh!, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.12,0:13:26.72,ENG,148,0,0,0,,- Dead broad off the table. - Where are we supposed to put her? The bed's taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.06,0:13:32.69,ENG,149,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.76,0:13:37.50,ENG,150,0,0,0,,I live in a swamp. I put up signs. I'm a terrifying ogre!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.60,0:13:40.23,ENG,151,0,0,0,,What do I have to do to get a little privacy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.31,0:13:42.74,ENG,152,0,0,0,,- Aah! - Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.81,0:13:45.54,ENG,153,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.61,0:13:49.21,ENG,154,0,0,0,,No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.62,0:14:01.52,ENG,155,0,0,0,,What are you doing in my swamp?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.13,0:14:12.54,ENG,156,0,0,0,,All right, get out of here. All of you, move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.60,0:14:15.04,ENG,157,0,0,0,,Come on! Let's go! Quickly. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.11,0:14:17.07,ENG,158,0,0,0,,No, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.14,0:14:19.37,ENG,159,0,0,0,,No, no. Not there. Not there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.01,0:14:25.92,ENG,160,0,0,0,,Hey, don't look at me. I didn't invite them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.98,0:14:28.08,ENG,161,0,0,0,,Oh, gosh, no one invited us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.15,0:14:30.71,ENG,162,0,0,0,,- What? - We were forced to come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.82,0:14:32.95,ENG,163,0,0,0,,- By who? - Lord Farquaad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.02,0:14:37.79,ENG,164,0,0,0,,He huffed und he puffed und he... signed an eviction notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.67,0:14:44.93,ENG,165,0,0,0,,Who knows where this Farquaad guy is?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.00,0:14:47.80,ENG,166,0,0,0,,Oh, I do. I know where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.87,0:14:51.57,ENG,167,0,0,0,,Does anyone else know where to find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.04,0:14:55.31,ENG,168,0,0,0,,- Anyone at all? - Me! Me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.38,0:14:57.31,ENG,169,0,0,0,,- Anyone? - Oh! Oh, pick me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.38,0:14:59.82,ENG,170,0,0,0,,Oh, I know! I know! Me, me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.88,0:15:03.01,ENG,171,0,0,0,,Okay, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.09,0:15:07.65,ENG,172,0,0,0,,Attention, all fairy tale things.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.73,0:15:12.42,ENG,173,0,0,0,,Do not get comfortable. Your welcome is officially worn out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.53,0:15:16.26,ENG,174,0,0,0,,In fact, I'm gonna see this guy Farquaad right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.33,0:15:19.43,ENG,175,0,0,0,,and get you all off my land and back where you came from!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.51,0:15:29.98,ENG,176,0,0,0,,Oh! You!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.05,0:15:31.98,ENG,177,0,0,0,,You're comin' with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.05,0:15:34.38,ENG,178,0,0,0,,All right, that's what I like to hear, man
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.45,0:15:38.29,ENG,179,0,0,0,,Shrek and donkey, two stalwart friends, off on a whirlwind big-city adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.36,0:15:40.35,ENG,180,0,0,0,,I love it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.43,0:15:43.62,ENG,181,0,0,0,,On the road again
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.70,0:15:45.66,ENG,182,0,0,0,,I can't wait to get on the road again
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.73,0:15:47.66,ENG,183,0,0,0,,What did I say about singing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.73,0:15:49.67,ENG,184,0,0,0,,- Can I whistle? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.73,0:15:52.53,ENG,185,0,0,0,,- Can I hum it? - All right, hum it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.30,0:16:25.36,ENG,186,0,0,0,,That's enough. He's ready to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.28,0:16:40.75,ENG,187,0,0,0,,Run, run, run, as fast as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.82,0:16:44.38,ENG,188,0,0,0,,You can't catch me. I'm the gingerbread man!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.46,0:16:48.05,ENG,189,0,0,0,,- You're a monster. - I'm not the monster here. You are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.13,0:16:52.39,ENG,190,0,0,0,,You and the rest of that fairy tale trash, poisoning my perfect world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.46,0:16:54.40,ENG,191,0,0,0,,Now, tell me! Where are the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.47,0:16:57.03,ENG,192,0,0,0,,Eat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.10,0:17:00.04,ENG,193,0,0,0,,I've tried to be fair to you creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.10,0:17:03.60,ENG,194,0,0,0,,Now my patience has reached its end! Tell me or I'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.68,0:17:06.47,ENG,195,0,0,0,,No, no, not the buttons. Not my gumdrop buttons.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.54,0:17:08.57,ENG,196,0,0,0,,All right then. Who's hiding them?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.65,0:17:13.98,ENG,197,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll tell you. Do you know the muffin man?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.05,0:17:16.42,ENG,198,0,0,0,,- The muffin man? - The muffin man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.49,0:17:19.92,ENG,199,0,0,0,,Yes, I know the muffin man, who lives on Drury Lane?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.99,0:17:23.43,ENG,200,0,0,0,,Well, she's married to the muffin man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.49,0:17:25.62,ENG,201,0,0,0,,- The muffin man? - The muffin man!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.70,0:17:28.72,ENG,202,0,0,0,,She's married to the muffin man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.80,0:17:30.46,ENG,203,0,0,0,,My lord! We found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.54,0:17:33.77,ENG,204,0,0,0,,Then what are you waiting for? Bring it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.72,0:17:52.09,ENG,205,0,0,0,,- Magic mirror...  - Don't tell him anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.16,0:17:54.49,ENG,206,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.56,0:17:58.33,ENG,207,0,0,0,,Evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.40,0:18:00.26,ENG,208,0,0,0,,Mirror, mirror, on the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.37,0:18:03.77,ENG,209,0,0,0,,Is this not the most perfect kingdom of them all?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.84,0:18:06.43,ENG,210,0,0,0,,Well, technically you're not a king.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.01,0:18:13.64,ENG,211,0,0,0,,- You were saying? - What I mean is, you're not a king yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.71,0:18:17.31,ENG,212,0,0,0,,But you can become one. All you have to do is marry a princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.38,0:18:20.37,ENG,213,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.45,0:18:24.11,ENG,214,0,0,0,,So, just sit back and relax, my lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.19,0:18:28.45,ENG,215,0,0,0,,because it's time for you to meet today's eligible bachelorettes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.56,0:18:32.15,ENG,216,0,0,0,,And here they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.23,0:18:37.19,ENG,217,0,0,0,,Bachelorette number one is a mentally abused shut-in from a kingdom far, far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.27,0:18:39.53,ENG,218,0,0,0,,She likes sushi and hot tubbing anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.60,0:18:43.06,ENG,219,0,0,0,,Her hobbies include cooking and cleaning for her two evil sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.14,0:18:45.54,ENG,220,0,0,0,,Please welcome Cinderella.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.61,0:18:49.67,ENG,221,0,0,0,,Bachelorette number two is a cape-wearing girl from the land of fancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.75,0:18:52.44,ENG,222,0,0,0,,Although she lives with seven other men, she's not easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.55,0:18:56.01,ENG,223,0,0,0,,Just kiss her dead, frozen lips and find out what a live wire she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.09,0:18:59.85,ENG,224,0,0,0,,Come on. Give it up for Snow White!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.92,0:19:02.55,ENG,225,0,0,0,,And last, but certainly not least,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.63,0:19:04.72,ENG,226,0,0,0,,bachelorette number three is a fiery redhead...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.80,0:19:07.36,ENG,227,0,0,0,,from a dragon-guarded castle surrounded by hot boiling lava!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.43,0:19:09.49,ENG,228,0,0,0,,But don't let that cool you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.80,0:19:16.87,ENG,229,0,0,0,,Yours for the rescuing, Princess Fiona!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.94,0:19:19.41,ENG,230,0,0,0,,So will it be bachelorette number one,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.48,0:19:23.00,ENG,231,0,0,0,,bachelorette number two or bachelorette number three?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.08,0:19:25.24,ENG,232,0,0,0,,- Two! Two! - Three! Three!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.32,0:19:26.68,ENG,233,0,0,0,,- Two! Two! - Three!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.75,0:19:28.88,ENG,234,0,0,0,,Three? One? Three?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.95,0:19:30.98,ENG,235,0,0,0,,Three! Pick number three, my lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.09,0:19:34.86,ENG,236,0,0,0,,Okay, okay, uh, number three!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.93,0:19:39.69,ENG,237,0,0,0,,Lord Farquaad, you've chosen Princess Fiona.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.63,0:19:46.97,ENG,238,0,0,0,,Princess Fiona.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.04,0:19:49.23,ENG,239,0,0,0,,She is perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.31,0:19:52.07,ENG,240,0,0,0,,All I have to do is just find someone who can go...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.14,0:19:54.41,ENG,241,0,0,0,,But I probably should mention the little thing that happens at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.48,0:19:56.41,ENG,242,0,0,0,,- I'll do it. - Yes, but after sunset...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.48,0:20:00.58,ENG,243,0,0,0,,Silence! I will make this Princess Fiona my queen,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.65,0:20:04.82,ENG,244,0,0,0,,and DuLoc will finally have the perfect king!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.89,0:20:07.12,ENG,245,0,0,0,,Captain, assemble your finet men.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.19,0:20:11.06,ENG,246,0,0,0,,We're going to have a tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.73,0:20:15.76,ENG,247,0,0,0,,But that's it. That'st it right there. That's DuLoc.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.83,0:20:17.89,ENG,248,0,0,0,,I told ya I'd find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.97,0:20:22.07,ENG,249,0,0,0,,So, that must be Lord Farquaad's castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.17,0:20:24.27,ENG,250,0,0,0,,Uh...huh. That's the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.34,0:20:27.78,ENG,251,0,0,0,,Do you think maybe he's compensating for something?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.02,0:20:33.98,ENG,252,0,0,0,,Hey, wait. Wait up, Shrek.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.05,0:20:36.92,ENG,253,0,0,0,,Hurry, darling. We're late. Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.16,0:20:44.99,ENG,254,0,0,0,,Wait a second. Look, I'm not gonna eat ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.06,0:20:49.00,ENG,255,0,0,0,,I just...  I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.53,0:21:21.09,ENG,256,0,0,0,,It's quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.53,0:21:25.83,ENG,257,0,0,0,,Too quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.41,0:21:32.54,ENG,258,0,0,0,,- WHere is everybody? - Hey, look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.92,0:21:49.36,ENG,259,0,0,0,,Welcome to DuLoc such a perfect town
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.43,0:21:52.83,ENG,260,0,0,0,,Here we have some rules Let us lay them down
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.93,0:21:56.83,ENG,261,0,0,0,,Don't make waves, stay inline and we'll get along fine
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.90,0:22:00.53,ENG,262,0,0,0,,DuLoc is a perfect place
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.61,0:22:05.17,ENG,263,0,0,0,,Please keep off of the grass Shine your shoes, wipe your... face
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.24,0:22:08.84,ENG,264,0,0,0,,DuLoc is, DuLoc is
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.91,0:22:12.37,ENG,265,0,0,0,,DuLoc is a perfect
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.45,0:22:15.89,ENG,266,0,0,0,,Place
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.12,0:22:23.86,ENG,267,0,0,0,,Wow! Let's do that again!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.93,0:22:26.59,ENG,268,0,0,0,,No. No. No, no, no! No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.23,0:22:31.36,ENG,269,0,0,0,,Brave knights.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.47,0:22:35.60,ENG,270,0,0,0,,You are the best and brightest in the land.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.67,0:22:38.11,ENG,271,0,0,0,,Today one of you shall prove himself...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.18,0:22:40.54,ENG,272,0,0,0,,All right. You're going the right way for a smacked bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.61,0:22:42.55,ENG,273,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.61,0:22:48.11,ENG,274,0,0,0,,That champion shall have the honour... no,no... the privilege...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.19,0:22:52.21,ENG,275,0,0,0,,to go forth and rescue the lovely Princess Fiona...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.32,0:22:55.66,ENG,276,0,0,0,,from the fiery keep of the dragon
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.73,0:22:59.96,ENG,277,0,0,0,,If for any reason the winner is unsuccessful,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.03,0:23:03.23,ENG,278,0,0,0,,the fist runner-up will take his place
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.30,0:23:06.10,ENG,279,0,0,0,,and so on and so forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.17,0:23:11.61,ENG,280,0,0,0,,Some of you may die, but it's a sacrifice I am willing to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.71,0:23:19.15,ENG,281,0,0,0,,Let the tournament begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.86,0:23:28.12,ENG,282,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.19,0:23:32.79,ENG,283,0,0,0,,- It's hideous! - Ah, that's not very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.86,0:23:35.30,ENG,284,0,0,0,,It's just a donkey. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.37,0:23:38.34,ENG,285,0,0,0,,Indeed. Knights, new plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.40,0:23:43.14,ENG,286,0,0,0,,The one who kills the ogre will be named champion! Have at him!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.21,0:23:47.14,ENG,287,0,0,0,,- Get him! - Oh, hey! Now come on! Hang on now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.21,0:23:49.51,ENG,288,0,0,0,,Go ahead! Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.58,0:23:53.28,ENG,289,0,0,0,,Can't we just settle this over a pint?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.35,0:23:54.61,ENG,290,0,0,0,,Kill the beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.69,0:23:59.15,ENG,291,0,0,0,,No? All right then.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.22,0:24:01.28,ENG,292,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.10,0:24:13.54,ENG,293,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.60,0:24:17.63,ENG,294,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.71,0:24:20.51,ENG,295,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.58,0:24:22.84,ENG,296,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.91,0:24:26.85,ENG,297,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.92,0:24:30.68,ENG,298,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.76,0:24:34.16,ENG,299,0,0,0,,Hey, Shrek, tag me! Tag me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.23,0:24:36.99,ENG,300,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.06,0:24:39.33,ENG,301,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.97,0:24:44.03,ENG,302,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.10,0:24:46.19,ENG,303,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.27,0:24:48.20,ENG,304,0,0,0,,The chair! Give him the chair!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.27,0:24:50.90,ENG,305,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.98,0:24:54.17,ENG,306,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.25,0:24:55.68,ENG,307,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.75,0:24:58.41,ENG,308,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.48,0:25:02.18,ENG,309,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.25,0:25:04.69,ENG,310,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.13,0:25:15.93,ENG,311,0,0,0,,Thank you! Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.00,0:25:18.40,ENG,312,0,0,0,,I'm here till Thursday. Try the veal! Ha, ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.84,0:25:26.81,ENG,313,0,0,0,,Shall I give the order, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.88,0:25:30.47,ENG,314,0,0,0,,No, I have a better idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.55,0:25:35.75,ENG,315,0,0,0,,People of DuLoc, I give you our champion!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.82,0:25:39.72,ENG,316,0,0,0,,- What? - Congratulations, ogre.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.79,0:25:44.12,ENG,317,0,0,0,,You've won the honour of embarking on a great and noble quest.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.20,0:25:48.60,ENG,318,0,0,0,,Quest? I'm already on a quest, a quest to get my swamp back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.67,0:25:51.90,ENG,319,0,0,0,,- Your swamp? - Yeah, my swamp!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.97,0:25:54.44,ENG,320,0,0,0,,Where you dumped those fairy tale creatures!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.17,0:25:59.27,ENG,321,0,0,0,,All right, ogre, I'll make you a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.34,0:26:03.14,ENG,322,0,0,0,,Go on this quest for me, and I'll give you your swamp back.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.21,0:26:05.94,ENG,323,0,0,0,,Exactly the way it was?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.02,0:26:08.78,ENG,324,0,0,0,,Down to the last slime-covered toadtool.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.85,0:26:12.08,ENG,325,0,0,0,,- And the squatters? - As good as gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.16,0:26:19.12,ENG,326,0,0,0,,What kind of quest?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.43,0:26:21.80,ENG,327,0,0,0,,Let me get this straight. You're gonna go fight a dragon...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.87,0:26:24.49,ENG,328,0,0,0,,and rescue a princess just so Farquaad will give you back a swamp...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.57,0:26:27.70,ENG,329,0,0,0,,which you only don't have because he filled it full of freaks in the first place. Is that about right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.77,0:26:32.14,ENG,330,0,0,0,,Maybe there's a good reason donkeys shouldn't talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.21,0:26:35.77,ENG,331,0,0,0,,I don't get it. Why don't you just pull some of that ogre stuff on him?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.85,0:26:37.78,ENG,332,0,0,0,,Throttle him, lay siege to his fortress,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.85,0:26:40.68,ENG,333,0,0,0,,grind his bones to make your bread, the whole ogre trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.75,0:26:42.69,ENG,334,0,0,0,,Oh, I know what.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.75,0:26:44.98,ENG,335,0,0,0,,Maybe I could have decapitated an entire village...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.06,0:26:47.18,ENG,336,0,0,0,,and put thier heads on a pike,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.26,0:26:50.89,ENG,337,0,0,0,,gotten a knife, cut open thier spleen and drink their fluids.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.96,0:26:53.09,ENG,338,0,0,0,,Does that sound good to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.20,0:26:55.83,ENG,339,0,0,0,,Uh, no, not really, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.90,0:26:59.70,ENG,340,0,0,0,,For your information, there's a lot more to ogres than people think.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.77,0:27:02.53,ENG,341,0,0,0,,- Example? - Example?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.61,0:27:08.74,ENG,342,0,0,0,,- Okay, um, ogres are like onions. - They stink?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.81,0:27:11.14,ENG,343,0,0,0,,- Yes  No! - They make you cry? - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.22,0:27:14.65,ENG,344,0,0,0,,You leave them out in the sun, they get all brown, start sproutin' little white hairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.72,0:27:16.71,ENG,345,0,0,0,,No! Layers!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.79,0:27:19.15,ENG,346,0,0,0,,Onions have layers.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.22,0:27:22.52,ENG,347,0,0,0,,Ogres have layers! Onions have layers.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.59,0:27:24.99,ENG,348,0,0,0,,You gt it? We both have layers.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.93,0:27:30.53,ENG,349,0,0,0,,Oh, you both have layers. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.60,0:27:34.00,ENG,350,0,0,0,,You know, not everybody likes onions.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.07,0:27:36.70,ENG,351,0,0,0,,Cake! Everybody loves cakes! Cakes have layers.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.77,0:27:40.71,ENG,352,0,0,0,,I don't care... what everyone likes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.78,0:27:44.48,ENG,353,0,0,0,,Ogres are not like cakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.32,0:27:49.72,ENG,354,0,0,0,,You know what else everybody likes? Parfaits.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.79,0:27:51.72,ENG,355,0,0,0,,Have you ever met a person, you, say, "Let's get some parfait,"
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.79,0:27:53.42,ENG,356,0,0,0,,they say, "No, I don't like no parfait"?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.46,0:27:55.43,ENG,357,0,0,0,,- Parfaits are delicious. - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.46,0:27:58.43,ENG,358,0,0,0,,You dense, irritating, miniature beast of burden!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.46,0:28:01.43,ENG,359,0,0,0,,Ogres are like onions! End of the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.47,0:28:03.59,ENG,360,0,0,0,,Bye-bye. See ya later.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.27,0:28:12.71,ENG,361,0,0,0,,Parfaits may be the most delicious thing on the whole damn planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.78,0:28:14.97,ENG,362,0,0,0,,You know, I think I preferred your humming.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.05,0:28:17.74,ENG,363,0,0,0,,Do you have a tissue or something? I'm making a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.82,0:28:20.72,ENG,364,0,0,0,,Just the word parfait make me start slobbering.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.16,0:28:31.06,ENG,365,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.70,0:28:39.16,ENG,366,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.81,0:28:45.71,ENG,367,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.81,0:28:49.75,ENG,368,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.81,0:28:52.75,ENG,369,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.85,0:28:56.75,ENG,370,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.86,0:28:59.95,ENG,371,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.02,0:29:02.49,ENG,372,0,0,0,,Ooh! Shrek! Did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.56,0:29:06.36,ENG,373,0,0,0,,You gotta warn somebody before you just crack one off. My mouth was open.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.43,0:29:10.16,ENG,374,0,0,0,,Believe me, Donkey, if it was me, you'd be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.23,0:29:13.00,ENG,375,0,0,0,,It's brimstone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.07,0:29:16.27,ENG,376,0,0,0,,- We must be getting close. - Yeah, right, brimstone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.34,0:29:20.44,ENG,377,0,0,0,,Don't be talking about it's the brimstone. I know what I smell. It's wasn't no brimstone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.51,0:29:22.45,ENG,378,0,0,0,,It didn't come off no stone neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.46,0:29:43.83,ENG,379,0,0,0,,Sure, it's big enough, but look at the location.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.94,0:29:51.67,ENG,380,0,0,0,,Uh, Shrek? Uh, remember when you said ogres have layers?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.74,0:29:53.68,ENG,381,0,0,0,,Oh, aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.74,0:29:57.34,ENG,382,0,0,0,,Well, I have a bit of a confession to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.41,0:30:00.78,ENG,383,0,0,0,,Donkeys don't have layers. We wear our fear right out there on our sleeves.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.88,0:30:04.95,ENG,384,0,0,0,,- Wait a second. Donkeys don't have sleeves. - You know what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.06,0:30:07.72,ENG,385,0,0,0,,You can't tell me you're afraid of heights.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.79,0:30:12.39,ENG,386,0,0,0,,I'm just a little uncomfortable about being on a rickely bridge over a boiling lake of lava!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.46,0:30:16.52,ENG,387,0,0,0,,Come on, Donkey. I'm right here beside ya, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.60,0:30:19.26,ENG,388,0,0,0,,For emotional support,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.34,0:30:23.90,ENG,389,0,0,0,,we'll just tackle this thing together one little baby stap at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.97,0:30:25.91,ENG,390,0,0,0,,- Really? - Really, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.98,0:30:29.21,ENG,391,0,0,0,,- Okay, that makes me feel so much better. - Just keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.28,0:30:33.88,ENG,392,0,0,0,,- And don't look down. - Okay, don't look down. Don't look down.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.95,0:30:37.32,ENG,393,0,0,0,,Don't look down. Keep on moving. Don't look down.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.42,0:30:41.22,ENG,394,0,0,0,,Shrek! I'm lookin' down!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.29,0:30:44.23,ENG,395,0,0,0,,Oh, God, I can't do this! Just let me off, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.29,0:30:47.86,ENG,396,0,0,0,,- But you're already halfway. - But I know that half is safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.93,0:30:50.73,ENG,397,0,0,0,,Okay, fine. I don't have time for this. You go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.80,0:30:53.24,ENG,398,0,0,0,,Shrek, no! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.30,0:30:56.40,ENG,399,0,0,0,,- Let's have a dance then, shall we? - Don't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.47,0:31:00.38,ENG,400,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry. Do what?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.44,0:31:03.54,ENG,401,0,0,0,,- Oh, this? - Yes, that!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.61,0:31:07.05,ENG,402,0,0,0,,Yes? Yes, do it. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.12,0:31:09.42,ENG,403,0,0,0,,No Shrek!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.49,0:31:12.61,ENG,404,0,0,0,,- No! Stop it! - You said do it! I'm doin' it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.69,0:31:16.96,ENG,405,0,0,0,,I'm gonna die. I'm gonna die. Shrek, I'm gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.63,0:31:23.62,ENG,406,0,0,0,,That'll do, Donkey. That'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.00,0:31:27.97,ENG,407,0,0,0,,Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.34,0:31:32.10,ENG,408,0,0,0,,So where is this fire-breathing pain-in-the-neck anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.18,0:31:35.94,ENG,409,0,0,0,,Inside, waiting for us to rescue her.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.01,0:31:38.91,ENG,410,0,0,0,,I was talkin' about the dragon, Shrek.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.40,0:31:56.33,ENG,411,0,0,0,,You afraid?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.40,0:31:59.70,ENG,412,0,0,0,,No, but...  Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.77,0:32:03.33,ENG,413,0,0,0,,Oh, good. Me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.41,0:32:06.81,ENG,414,0,0,0,,'Cause there's nothin' wrong with bein' afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.88,0:32:10.11,ENG,415,0,0,0,,Fear's a sensible response to an unfamiliar situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.21,0:32:12.27,ENG,416,0,0,0,,Unfamiliar dangerous situation, I might add.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.35,0:32:14.98,ENG,417,0,0,0,,With a dragon that breathes fire and eats knights and breathes fire,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.05,0:32:18.51,ENG,418,0,0,0,,it sure doesn't mean you're a coward if you're a little scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.59,0:32:22.58,ENG,419,0,0,0,,I sure as heck ain't no coward. I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.69,0:32:26.03,ENG,420,0,0,0,,Donkey, two things, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.10,0:32:28.66,ENG,421,0,0,0,,Shut... up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.73,0:32:31.50,ENG,422,0,0,0,,Now go over there and see if you can find any stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.57,0:32:34.20,ENG,423,0,0,0,,Stairs? I thought we was lookin' for the princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.27,0:32:39.17,ENG,424,0,0,0,,The princess will be up the stairs in the highest room in the tallest tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.24,0:32:42.84,ENG,425,0,0,0,,- What makes you think she'll be there? - I read it in a book once.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.91,0:32:46.85,ENG,426,0,0,0,,Cool. You handle the dragon. I'll handle the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.92,0:32:49.98,ENG,427,0,0,0,,I'll find those stairs. I'll whip their butt too.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.05,0:32:52.02,ENG,428,0,0,0,,Those stairs won't know which way they're goin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.49,0:32:58.48,ENG,429,0,0,0,,I'm gonna take drastic steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.56,0:33:01.36,ENG,430,0,0,0,,Kick it to the kerb. Don't mess with me. I'm the stair master.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.43,0:33:05.99,ENG,431,0,0,0,,I've mastered the stairs. I wish I had a step right here. I'd step all over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.97,0:33:12.53,ENG,432,0,0,0,,Well, at least we know where the princess is, but where's the...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.61,0:33:16.84,ENG,433,0,0,0,,Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.46,0:33:32.69,ENG,434,0,0,0,,Donkey, look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.34,0:33:46.37,ENG,435,0,0,0,,Got ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.65,0:34:29.28,ENG,436,0,0,0,,Oh, what large teeth you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.35,0:34:33.19,ENG,437,0,0,0,,I mean, white, sparkling teeth. I know you probably hear this all the time from your food,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.26,0:34:37.42,ENG,438,0,0,0,,but you must bleach, 'cause that is one dazzling smile you got there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.49,0:34:39.99,ENG,439,0,0,0,,Do I detect a hint of minty freshness?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.06,0:34:44.83,ENG,440,0,0,0,,And you know what else? You're... you're a girl dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.90,0:34:49.43,ENG,441,0,0,0,,Oh, sure! I mean, of course you're a girl dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.51,0:34:53.31,ENG,442,0,0,0,,You're just reeking off feminine beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.38,0:34:55.71,ENG,443,0,0,0,,What's the matter with you? You got something in your eye?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.72,0:35:01.12,ENG,444,0,0,0,,Man, I'd really love to stay, but, you know, I'm, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.22,0:35:05.18,ENG,445,0,0,0,,I'm an asthmatic, and I don't know if it'd work out if you're gonna blow smoke rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.26,0:35:07.19,ENG,446,0,0,0,,Shrek!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.26,0:35:10.99,ENG,447,0,0,0,,No! Shrek! Shrek!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.76,0:35:47.70,ENG,448,0,0,0,,- WAke up! - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.76,0:35:49.39,ENG,449,0,0,0,,Are you Princess Fiona?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.47,0:35:54.84,ENG,450,0,0,0,,I am, awaiting a knight so bold as to rescue me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.91,0:35:56.90,ENG,451,0,0,0,,Oh, that's nice. Now let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.97,0:35:59.00,ENG,452,0,0,0,,But wait, Sir Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.08,0:36:01.37,ENG,453,0,0,0,,This be our first meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.45,0:36:05.18,ENG,454,0,0,0,,Should it not be a wonderful, romantic moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.25,0:36:09.58,ENG,455,0,0,0,,- Yeah, sorry, lady. There's no time. - Hey, wait. What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.65,0:36:11.75,ENG,456,0,0,0,,You should sweep me off my feet...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.82,0:36:15.22,ENG,457,0,0,0,,out yonder window and down a rope onto your valiant steed.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.29,0:36:18.09,ENG,458,0,0,0,,You've had a lot of time to plan this, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.50,0:36:25.40,ENG,459,0,0,0,,But we have to savour this moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.47,0:36:28.23,ENG,460,0,0,0,,You could recite an epic poem for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.31,0:36:30.77,ENG,461,0,0,0,,A ballad? A sonnet!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.84,0:36:34.11,ENG,462,0,0,0,,- A limerick? Or something! - I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.18,0:36:38.61,ENG,463,0,0,0,,Can I at least know the name of my champion?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.68,0:36:40.62,ENG,464,0,0,0,,Um, Shrek.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.68,0:36:44.42,ENG,465,0,0,0,,Sir Shrek.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.49,0:36:49.22,ENG,466,0,0,0,,I pray that you take this favour as a token of my gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.36,0:36:52.35,ENG,467,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.37,0:36:58.23,ENG,468,0,0,0,,You didn't slay the dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.30,0:37:00.27,ENG,469,0,0,0,,It's on my to-do list. Now come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.84,0:37:02.73,ENG,470,0,0,0,,But this isn't right!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.51,0:37:05.77,ENG,471,0,0,0,,You were meant to charge in, sword drawn, banner flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.84,0:37:07.94,ENG,472,0,0,0,,That's what all the other knights did.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.51,0:37:09.77,ENG,473,0,0,0,,Yeah, right before they burst into flame.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.38,0:37:12.24,ENG,474,0,0,0,,That's not the point. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.02,0:37:16.49,ENG,475,0,0,0,,Wait. Where are you going? The exit's over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.55,0:37:18.61,ENG,476,0,0,0,,Well, I have to save my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.69,0:37:21.89,ENG,477,0,0,0,,What kind of knight are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.99,0:37:24.43,ENG,478,0,0,0,,One of a kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.49,0:37:26.86,ENG,479,0,0,0,,Slow down. Slow down, baby, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.93,0:37:29.16,ENG,480,0,0,0,,I believe it's healthy to get to know someone over a long period of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.23,0:37:33.83,ENG,481,0,0,0,,Just call me old-fashioned.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.90,0:37:37.43,ENG,482,0,0,0,,I don't want to rush into a physical relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.51,0:37:40.97,ENG,483,0,0,0,,I'm not that emotionally ready for commitment of, uh, this..
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.04,0:37:43.34,ENG,484,0,0,0,,Magnitude really is the word I'm looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.41,0:37:46.91,ENG,485,0,0,0,,Magnitude... Hey, that is unwanted physical contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.02,0:37:49.49,ENG,486,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.55,0:37:52.82,ENG,487,0,0,0,,Okay, okay. Let's just back up a little and take this one step at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.89,0:37:57.02,ENG,488,0,0,0,,We really should get to know each other first as friends or pen pals.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.09,0:38:01.33,ENG,489,0,0,0,,I'm on the road a lot, but I just love receiving cards...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.40,0:38:03.83,ENG,490,0,0,0,,I'd really love to stay, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.90,0:38:06.49,ENG,491,0,0,0,,Don't do that. That's my tail! That's my personal tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.57,0:38:10.01,ENG,492,0,0,0,,You're gonna tear it off. I don't give permission What are you gonna do with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.07,0:38:13.87,ENG,493,0,0,0,,Hey, now. No way. No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.01,0:38:16.06,ENG,494,0,0,0,,No, no! No. No, no, no! No! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.57,0:38:45.54,ENG,495,0,0,0,,- Hi, Princess! - It talks!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.61,0:38:49.38,ENG,496,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's getting him to shut up that's the trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.95,0:39:26.85,ENG,497,0,0,0,,Okay, you two, head for the exit!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.98,0:39:30.51,ENG,498,0,0,0,,I'll take care of the dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.13,0:39:42.53,ENG,499,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.11,0:40:29.91,ENG,500,0,0,0,,You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.98,0:40:31.78,ENG,501,0,0,0,,You rescued me! You're amizing. You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.85,0:40:33.61,ENG,502,0,0,0,,You're wonderful. You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.69,0:40:37.98,ENG,503,0,0,0,,a little unorthodox I'll admit.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.05,0:40:42.99,ENG,504,0,0,0,,But thy deed is great, and thine heart is pure.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.06,0:40:46.86,ENG,505,0,0,0,,I am eternally in your debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.93,0:40:51.30,ENG,506,0,0,0,,And where would a brave knight be without his noble steed?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.37,0:40:56.03,ENG,507,0,0,0,,I hope you heard that. She called me a noble steed. She think I'm a steed.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.11,0:40:59.00,ENG,508,0,0,0,,The battle is won.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.38,0:41:01.87,ENG,509,0,0,0,,You may remove your helmet, good Sir Knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.95,0:41:04.54,ENG,510,0,0,0,,- Uh, no. - Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.61,0:41:06.84,ENG,511,0,0,0,,I have helmet hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.92,0:41:10.15,ENG,512,0,0,0,,Please. I would'st look upon the face of my rescuer.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.22,0:41:12.81,ENG,513,0,0,0,,No, no, you wouldn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.89,0:41:15.36,ENG,514,0,0,0,,But how will you kiss me?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.43,0:41:19.19,ENG,515,0,0,0,,What? That wasn't in the job description.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.26,0:41:21.66,ENG,516,0,0,0,,Maybe it's a perk.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.73,0:41:26.17,ENG,517,0,0,0,,No. It's destiny. Oh, you must know how it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.24,0:41:30.00,ENG,518,0,0,0,,A princess locked in a tower and beset by a dragon...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.11,0:41:33.04,ENG,519,0,0,0,,is rescue by a brave knight,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.11,0:41:36.41,ENG,520,0,0,0,,and then they share true love's first kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.48,0:41:39.17,ENG,521,0,0,0,,Hmm? With Shrek? You think... Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.25,0:41:41.85,ENG,522,0,0,0,,Wait. You think Shrek is your true love?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.92,0:41:43.91,ENG,523,0,0,0,,Well, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.96,0:41:50.43,ENG,524,0,0,0,,You think that Shrek is your true love!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.49,0:41:52.43,ENG,525,0,0,0,,What is so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.21,0:41:56.30,ENG,526,0,0,0,,Let's just say, I'm not your type, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.38,0:41:59.90,ENG,527,0,0,0,,Of course you are. You're my rescuer.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.98,0:42:02.45,ENG,528,0,0,0,,Now...  Now remove your helmet.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.52,0:42:04.75,ENG,529,0,0,0,,Look. I really don't think this is a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.82,0:42:06.81,ENG,530,0,0,0,,- Just take off the helmet. - I'm not going to.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.89,0:42:08.08,ENG,531,0,0,0,,- Take it off! - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.15,0:42:10.25,ENG,532,0,0,0,,- Now! - Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.32,0:42:14.82,ENG,533,0,0,0,,Easy. As you command, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.87,0:42:28.31,ENG,534,0,0,0,,You...  You're a... an ogre.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.37,0:42:32.28,ENG,535,0,0,0,,Oh, you were expecting Prince Charming.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.38,0:42:34.87,ENG,536,0,0,0,,Well, yes, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.78,0:42:40.05,ENG,537,0,0,0,,Oh no. This is all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.12,0:42:42.45,ENG,538,0,0,0,,You're not supposed to be an ogre.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.52,0:42:47.79,ENG,539,0,0,0,,Princess, I was sent to rescue you by Lord Farquaad, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.86,0:42:49.79,ENG,540,0,0,0,,He's the one who wants to marry you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.86,0:42:51.80,ENG,541,0,0,0,,Then why didn't he come to rescue me?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.86,0:42:56.20,ENG,542,0,0,0,,Good question. You should ask him that when we get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.27,0:42:59.33,ENG,543,0,0,0,,But I have to be rescued by my true love,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.41,0:43:02.17,ENG,544,0,0,0,,not by some ogre and his... his pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.24,0:43:04.30,ENG,545,0,0,0,,Well so much for noble steed.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.38,0:43:07.00,ENG,546,0,0,0,,Look princess. You're not making my job any easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.08,0:43:10.48,ENG,547,0,0,0,,Well I'm sorry, but your job is not my problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.55,0:43:15.82,ENG,548,0,0,0,,You can tell Lord Farquaad that if he wants to rescue me properly,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.89,0:43:18.22,ENG,549,0,0,0,,I'll be waiting for him right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.29,0:43:23.32,ENG,550,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm no ones messenger boy, all right? I'm a delivery boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.43,0:43:25.69,ENG,551,0,0,0,,You wouldn't dare.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.76,0:43:27.76,ENG,552,0,0,0,,- Ya comin', Donkey? - Put me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.83,0:43:29.82,ENG,553,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm right behind ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.90,0:43:33.50,ENG,554,0,0,0,,Put me down or you will suffer the consequences!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.57,0:43:36.57,ENG,555,0,0,0,,This is not dignified! Put me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.54,0:43:41.04,ENG,556,0,0,0,,Okay, so here's another question.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.11,0:43:44.17,ENG,557,0,0,0,,Say there's a woman that digs you, right, but you don't really like her that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.25,0:43:46.62,ENG,558,0,0,0,,How do you let her down real easy so her feelings aren't hurt,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.69,0:43:49.21,ENG,559,0,0,0,,but you don't get burned to a crisp and eaten?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.29,0:43:52.05,ENG,560,0,0,0,,You just tell her she's not your true love.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.12,0:43:54.85,ENG,561,0,0,0,,Everyone knows it what happens when you find your...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.60,0:43:59.86,ENG,562,0,0,0,,The sooner we get to DuLoc the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.97,0:44:02.90,ENG,563,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. You're gonna love it there, Princess. It's beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.97,0:44:06.73,ENG,564,0,0,0,,And what of my groom-to-be? Lord Farquaad? What's he like?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.81,0:44:08.93,ENG,565,0,0,0,,Well, let me put it this way, Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.01,0:44:14.14,ENG,566,0,0,0,,Men of Farquaad's stature are in short supply.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.11,0:44:19.21,ENG,567,0,0,0,,I don't know. There are those who think little of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.32,0:44:24.22,ENG,568,0,0,0,,Stop it. Stop it, both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.29,0:44:29.25,ENG,569,0,0,0,,You know, you're just jealous that you can never measure up to a great ruler like lord Farquaad.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.33,0:44:32.26,ENG,570,0,0,0,,Yeah. Well maybe you're right, Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.33,0:44:35.63,ENG,571,0,0,0,,But I'd let you do the "measuring" when you see him tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.70,0:44:39.93,ENG,572,0,0,0,,Tomorrow? It's take that long?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.01,0:44:44.70,ENG,573,0,0,0,,- Shouldn't we stop to make camp? - No, that'll take longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.81,0:44:49.25,ENG,574,0,0,0,,- We can keep going. - But there are robbers in the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.32,0:44:52.65,ENG,575,0,0,0,,Whoa! Time out, Shrek! Camping's starting to sound good.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.72,0:44:56.81,ENG,576,0,0,0,,Hey. Come on. I'm scarier than anything we're going to see in this forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.89,0:44:59.26,ENG,577,0,0,0,,I need to find somewhere to camp now!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.17,0:45:10.26,ENG,578,0,0,0,,- Hey! over here. - Shrek, we can do better than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.34,0:45:12.93,ENG,579,0,0,0,,Now, I don't think this is fit for a princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.01,0:45:15.90,ENG,580,0,0,0,,No, no, it's perfect. It just needs a few homey touches.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.97,0:45:20.81,ENG,581,0,0,0,,Homey touches? Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.88,0:45:25.15,ENG,582,0,0,0,,A door? Well, gentlemen, I bid thee good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.22,0:45:27.62,ENG,583,0,0,0,,Do you want me to come in and read you a bedtime story? 'cause I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.69,0:45:30.02,ENG,584,0,0,0,,I said good night!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.46,0:45:34.45,ENG,585,0,0,0,,Shrek, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.53,0:45:37.55,ENG,586,0,0,0,,I just... You know... Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.63,0:45:40.26,ENG,587,0,0,0,,I was just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.57,0:45:49.17,ENG,588,0,0,0,,And, uh, that one, that's Throwback,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.24,0:45:52.68,ENG,589,0,0,0,,the only ogre to ever spit over three wheat fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.75,0:45:55.84,ENG,590,0,0,0,,Right. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.91,0:45:58.85,ENG,591,0,0,0,,Hey, can you tell my future form these stars?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.92,0:46:02.51,ENG,592,0,0,0,,Well, the stars don't tell the future, Donkey. They tell stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.59,0:46:06.18,ENG,593,0,0,0,,Look, there's Bloodnut, the Flatulent.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.26,0:46:09.89,ENG,594,0,0,0,,- You can guess what he is famous for. - All right. Now I know you're making this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.96,0:46:12.69,ENG,595,0,0,0,,No. Look. There he is,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.77,0:46:15.86,ENG,596,0,0,0,,and there's the group of hunters running away from his stench.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.93,0:46:18.49,ENG,597,0,0,0,,Man, there ain't nothin' but a bunch of little dots.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.60,0:46:22.54,ENG,598,0,0,0,,You know donkey, sometimes things are more than they appear.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.84,0:46:26.90,ENG,599,0,0,0,,Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.75,0:46:33.51,ENG,600,0,0,0,,Hey, Shrek, what we gonna do when we get our swamp back, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.59,0:46:35.38,ENG,601,0,0,0,,Our swamp?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.45,0:46:37.55,ENG,602,0,0,0,,You know. When we're through rescuing the princess and all that stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.62,0:46:42.39,ENG,603,0,0,0,,We? Donkey, there is no "we". There's no "our".
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.46,0:46:44.73,ENG,604,0,0,0,,There's just me and my swamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.80,0:46:49.06,ENG,605,0,0,0,,And the first thing I'm gonna do is build a ten-foot wall around my land.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.13,0:46:51.63,ENG,606,0,0,0,,You cut me deep, Shrek.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.70,0:46:55.04,ENG,607,0,0,0,,You cut me real deep just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.14,0:46:57.07,ENG,608,0,0,0,,You know what I think?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.14,0:47:00.27,ENG,609,0,0,0,,I think this whole wall thing is just a way to keep somebody out.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.35,0:47:04.54,ENG,610,0,0,0,,- No, do ya think? - Are you hidin' something?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.62,0:47:06.58,ENG,611,0,0,0,,Never mind, Donkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.65,0:47:10.09,ENG,612,0,0,0,,Oh, this is another one of those onion things, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.16,0:47:13.75,ENG,613,0,0,0,,No, this is one of those drop-it and leave-it-alone things.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.83,0:47:17.59,ENG,614,0,0,0,,- Why don't you want to talk about it? - Why do you want to talk about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.66,0:47:19.46,ENG,615,0,0,0,,- Oh, Why you block? - I'm not blocking.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.53,0:47:21.80,ENG,616,0,0,0,,- Oh yes you are. - Donkey, I'm warning you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.87,0:47:25.36,ENG,617,0,0,0,,- Who are you trying to keep out? Just tell me that Shrek. Who? - Everyone! Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.64,0:47:29.11,ENG,618,0,0,0,,Oh, now we're gettin' somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.17,0:47:32.47,ENG,619,0,0,0,,Oh, for 'the love of Pete!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.54,0:47:34.98,ENG,620,0,0,0,,Hey, what's your problem Shrek? What do you got against the whole world anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.05,0:47:37.28,ENG,621,0,0,0,,Look. I'm not the one with the problem, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.35,0:47:40.32,ENG,622,0,0,0,,It's the world that seems to have a problem with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.39,0:47:44.29,ENG,623,0,0,0,,People take one look at me and go, "Aah! Help! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.36,0:47:48.12,ENG,624,0,0,0,,A big, stupid, ugly ogre!"
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.19,0:47:52.39,ENG,625,0,0,0,,They judge me, before they even know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.50,0:47:54.40,ENG,626,0,0,0,,That's why I'm better off alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.34,0:48:04.54,ENG,627,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.61,0:48:10.31,ENG,628,0,0,0,,When we met, I didn't think you're was just a big, stupid, ugly ogre.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.38,0:48:13.32,ENG,629,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.39,0:48:16.82,ENG,630,0,0,0,,So, uh, are there any donkeys up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.89,0:48:20.19,ENG,631,0,0,0,,Well, there's, um, Gabby,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.36,0:48:22.62,ENG,632,0,0,0,,the Small and Annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.73,0:48:27.67,ENG,633,0,0,0,,Okay, okay. I see it, now. The big shiny one, right there. That's one there?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.73,0:48:30.90,ENG,634,0,0,0,,- That's the moon. - Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.26,0:48:54.69,ENG,635,0,0,0,,Again. Show me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.13,0:49:03.23,ENG,636,0,0,0,,Mirror, mirror, show her to me. Show me the princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.44,0:49:12.24,ENG,637,0,0,0,,Ah. Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.47,0:50:18.38,ENG,638,0,0,0,,Mmm, yeah, you know I like it like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.44,0:50:22.78,ENG,639,0,0,0,,- Oh come on, baby. I said I like it. - Donkey, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.85,0:50:25.41,ENG,640,0,0,0,,- Huh? What? - Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.48,0:50:27.45,ENG,641,0,0,0,,- What? - Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.52,0:50:30.78,ENG,642,0,0,0,,How do you like your eggs?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.86,0:50:34.82,ENG,643,0,0,0,,- Good morning, Princess! - What's all this about?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.89,0:50:38.85,ENG,644,0,0,0,,You know, we kind of got of to a bad start yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.93,0:50:40.96,ENG,645,0,0,0,,I wanted to make it up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.03,0:50:45.60,ENG,646,0,0,0,,I mean, after all, you did rescue me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.67,0:50:48.66,ENG,647,0,0,0,,Uh, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.74,0:50:52.54,ENG,648,0,0,0,,Well, eat up. We've got a big day ahead of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.02,0:50:58.98,ENG,649,0,0,0,,Shrek!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.05,0:51:00.95,ENG,650,0,0,0,,What? It's a compliment.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.02,0:51:03.99,ENG,651,0,0,0,,Better out than in, I always say.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.06,0:51:07.82,ENG,652,0,0,0,,Well, it's no way to behave in front of a princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.89,0:51:10.52,ENG,653,0,0,0,,- Thanks - She's as nasty as you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.60,0:51:15.46,ENG,654,0,0,0,,You know, you're not exactly what I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.53,0:51:20.63,ENG,655,0,0,0,,Well, maybe you shouldn't judge people before you get to know them.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.78,0:51:27.71,ENG,656,0,0,0,,Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.78,0:51:30.48,ENG,657,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.55,0:51:33.45,ENG,658,0,0,0,,Be still, mon cherie, for I am your saviour!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.55,0:51:38.01,ENG,659,0,0,0,,And I am rescuing you from this green...beast
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.73,0:51:43.06,ENG,660,0,0,0,,That's my princess! Go find your own!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.13,0:51:48.19,ENG,661,0,0,0,,Please, monster! Can't you see I'm a little busy here?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.27,0:51:51.86,ENG,662,0,0,0,,Look, pal. I don't know who you think you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.94,0:51:54.53,ENG,663,0,0,0,,Oh, of course! How rude that was.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.61,0:51:56.70,ENG,664,0,0,0,,Please, let me introduce myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.78,0:51:59.68,ENG,665,0,0,0,,Oh, Merry Men!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.82,0:52:07.91,ENG,666,0,0,0,,I steal from the rich and give to the needy
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.99,0:52:10.11,ENG,667,0,0,0,,- He takes a wee percentage - But I'm not greedy
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.19,0:52:12.21,ENG,668,0,0,0,,I rescue pretty damsels Man, I'm good
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.29,0:52:15.26,ENG,669,0,0,0,,What a guy, Monsieur Hood
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.96,0:52:21.23,ENG,670,0,0,0,,I like an honest fight and a saucy little maid
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.30,0:52:23.56,ENG,671,0,0,0,,What he's basically saying is he likes to get... Paid
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.64,0:52:26.23,ENG,672,0,0,0,,So...When an ogre in the bush grabs a lady by the tush
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.30,0:52:28.60,ENG,673,0,0,0,,- That's bad  - That's bad
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.67,0:52:30.94,ENG,674,0,0,0,,When a beauty's with a beast it makes me awfully mad
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.01,0:52:32.94,ENG,675,0,0,0,,He's mad He's really, really mad
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.01,0:52:34.91,ENG,676,0,0,0,,I'll take my blade and ram it through your heart
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.98,0:52:39.58,ENG,677,0,0,0,,Keep your eyes on me, boys 'cause I'm about to start
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.16,0:52:47.79,ENG,678,0,0,0,,Man, that was annoying!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.86,0:52:49.62,ENG,679,0,0,0,,Oh, you little...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.86,0:53:19.92,ENG,680,0,0,0,,Um, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.26,0:53:24.25,ENG,681,0,0,0,,Hold the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.73,0:53:27.70,ENG,682,0,0,0,,Oh! Whoa!, whoa, whoa. Hold on now.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.77,0:53:29.79,ENG,683,0,0,0,,- Where did that come from? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.87,0:53:32.77,ENG,684,0,0,0,,That! Back there. That was amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.84,0:53:34.77,ENG,685,0,0,0,,Where did you learn that?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.84,0:53:37.97,ENG,686,0,0,0,,Well-When one lives alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.04,0:53:40.81,ENG,687,0,0,0,,uh, one has to learn these things in case there's a...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.88,0:53:43.51,ENG,688,0,0,0,,- There is an arrow in your butt! - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.58,0:53:47.38,ENG,689,0,0,0,,- What? Oh, would you look at that? - Oh, no. This is all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.45,0:53:49.39,ENG,690,0,0,0,,- I'm so sorry.  - Why? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.45,0:53:52.82,ENG,691,0,0,0,,- Shrek's hurt. - Shrek's hurt. Shrek's hurt? Oh, no, Shrek's gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.89,0:53:56.69,ENG,692,0,0,0,,- Donkey, I'm okay. - You can't do this to me Shrek. I'm too young for you to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.76,0:53:58.89,ENG,693,0,0,0,,Keep your legs elevated. Turn your head and cough.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.96,0:54:01.99,ENG,694,0,0,0,,- Does anyone know how the Heimlich? - Donkey! Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.07,0:54:06.70,ENG,695,0,0,0,,If you want to help Shrek, run into the woods and find me a blue flower with red thorns.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.77,0:54:10.37,ENG,696,0,0,0,,Blue flower, red thorns. Okay, I'm on it. Blue flower, red thorns.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.44,0:54:13.90,ENG,697,0,0,0,,Don't die Shrek. And if you see a long tunnel, stay away from the light!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.98,0:54:17.14,ENG,698,0,0,0,,- Donkey! - Oh, yeah. Right. Blue Flower, red thorns.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.25,0:54:19.55,ENG,699,0,0,0,,- Blue flower, red thorns. - What are the flowers for?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.62,0:54:21.85,ENG,700,0,0,0,,- For getting rid of the Donkey. - Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.92,0:54:24.32,ENG,701,0,0,0,,Now you hold still, and I'll yank this thing out.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.39,0:54:26.58,ENG,702,0,0,0,,Ow! Hey! Easy with the yankin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.66,0:54:29.32,ENG,703,0,0,0,,- I'm sorry, but it has to come out. - No, it's tender.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.39,0:54:31.16,ENG,704,0,0,0,,Now, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.23,0:54:33.32,ENG,705,0,0,0,,- What you're doing here is the opposite of help. - Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.40,0:54:36.06,ENG,706,0,0,0,,- Look, time out. - Would you...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.13,0:54:40.59,ENG,707,0,0,0,,Okay. What do you propose we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.67,0:54:43.40,ENG,708,0,0,0,,Blue flower, red thorns. Blue flower, red thorns. Blue flower, red thorns.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.48,0:54:45.88,ENG,709,0,0,0,,This would be so much easier if I wasn't colour-blind!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.94,0:54:48.04,ENG,710,0,0,0,,Blue flower, red thorns
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.11,0:54:50.51,ENG,711,0,0,0,,Hold on, Shrek! I'm comin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.02,0:54:54.18,ENG,712,0,0,0,,Ow! Not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.25,0:54:56.78,ENG,713,0,0,0,,Okay. Okay, I can nearly see the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.86,0:54:59.48,ENG,714,0,0,0,,It's just about...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.03,0:55:07.43,ENG,715,0,0,0,,Nothing happened. We were just
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.50,0:55:10.23,ENG,716,0,0,0,,Look, if you wanted to be alone, all you had to do is ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.30,0:55:13.57,ENG,717,0,0,0,,Oh, come on! That's the last thing on my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.64,0:55:17.30,ENG,718,0,0,0,,The princess here was just...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.48,0:55:23.21,ENG,719,0,0,0,,Hey, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.28,0:55:26.11,ENG,720,0,0,0,,That's... Is that blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.40,0:55:46.06,ENG,721,0,0,0,,My beloved monster and me
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.34,0:55:51.83,ENG,722,0,0,0,,We go everywhere together
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.91,0:55:56.64,ENG,723,0,0,0,,Wearin' a raincoat that has four sleeves
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.72,0:56:01.35,ENG,724,0,0,0,,Gets us through all kinds of weather
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.42,0:56:06.69,ENG,725,0,0,0,,She will always be the only thing
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.76,0:56:11.29,ENG,726,0,0,0,,That comes between me and the awful sting
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.36,0:56:16.43,ENG,727,0,0,0,,That comes from living in a world that's so damn mean
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.57,0:56:58.51,ENG,728,0,0,0,,There it is, Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.58,0:57:00.94,ENG,729,0,0,0,,Your future awaits you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.01,0:57:03.28,ENG,730,0,0,0,,- That's Duloc? - Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.35,0:57:06.01,ENG,731,0,0,0,,You know, Shrek thinks Lord Farquaad's compensating for something,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.08,0:57:08.61,ENG,732,0,0,0,,which I think means, he has a really...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.69,0:57:10.62,ENG,733,0,0,0,,Um, I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.69,0:57:13.12,ENG,734,0,0,0,,- I guess we better move on. - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.19,0:57:15.28,ENG,735,0,0,0,,But Shrek?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.36,0:57:18.16,ENG,736,0,0,0,,I'm...  I'm worried about Donkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.23,0:57:20.60,ENG,737,0,0,0,,- What? - I mean, look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.70,0:57:23.69,ENG,738,0,0,0,,- He doesn't look so good. - What are you talking about? I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.77,0:57:28.80,ENG,739,0,0,0,,Well, that's what they always say, and the next thing you know, you're on your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.87,0:57:31.34,ENG,740,0,0,0,,- Dead. - You know, she's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.41,0:57:34.31,ENG,741,0,0,0,,You look awful. Do you want to sit down?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.38,0:57:37.11,ENG,742,0,0,0,,- You know, I'll make you up some tea. - Well, I didn't want to say nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.18,0:57:39.95,ENG,743,0,0,0,,but I've got this twinge in my neck, and when I turn my head like this, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.02,0:57:41.45,ENG,744,0,0,0,,Ow! See?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.52,0:57:44.58,ENG,745,0,0,0,,- Who's hungry? I'll find us some dinner. - I'll get the firewood.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.69,0:57:49.18,ENG,746,0,0,0,,Hey, where are you goin'? Oh man, I can't feel my toes!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.26,0:57:51.79,ENG,747,0,0,0,,I don't have any toes!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.86,0:57:54.20,ENG,748,0,0,0,,I think I need a hug.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.07,0:58:04.03,ENG,749,0,0,0,,Mmm. This is good. This is really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.24,0:58:08.51,ENG,750,0,0,0,,- What is this? - Uh, weedrat.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.58,0:58:10.71,ENG,751,0,0,0,,Rotisserie style.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.78,0:58:13.31,ENG,752,0,0,0,,No kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.38,0:58:15.32,ENG,753,0,0,0,,Well, this is delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.39,0:58:17.48,ENG,754,0,0,0,,Well, they're also great in stews.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.56,0:58:21.82,ENG,755,0,0,0,,Now, I don't mean to brag, but I make a mean wheedrat stew.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.50,0:58:29.66,ENG,756,0,0,0,,I guess I'll be dining a little differently tomorrow night.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.73,0:58:34.83,ENG,757,0,0,0,,Maybe you can come visit me in the swamp sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.91,0:58:37.07,ENG,758,0,0,0,,I'll cook all kinds of stuff for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.14,0:58:41.74,ENG,759,0,0,0,,Swamp toast soup, fish eye tartare... you name it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.11,0:58:44.24,ENG,760,0,0,0,,I'd like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.16,0:58:54.39,ENG,761,0,0,0,,See the pyramids along the Nile
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.46,0:58:57.09,ENG,762,0,0,0,,Um, Princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.16,0:59:01.43,ENG,763,0,0,0,,- Watch the sunrise from a tropic isle  - -Yes, Shrek?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.50,0:59:05.37,ENG,764,0,0,0,,- I was wondering - ust remember, darling all the while
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.44,0:59:07.70,ENG,765,0,0,0,,Are, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.77,0:59:10.37,ENG,766,0,0,0,,You belong to me
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.44,0:59:13.21,ENG,767,0,0,0,,Are you gonna eat that?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.02,0:59:24.11,ENG,768,0,0,0,,- Man, isn't this romantic? Just look at that sunset. - Sunset?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.19,0:59:26.71,ENG,769,0,0,0,,Oh, no! I mean, it's late.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.82,0:59:28.72,ENG,770,0,0,0,,- I...  It's very late. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.79,0:59:31.73,ENG,771,0,0,0,,Wait a minute. I see what's goin' on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.80,0:59:34.77,ENG,772,0,0,0,,- You're afraid of the dark, aren't you? - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.83,0:59:38.83,ENG,773,0,0,0,,Yes, that's it. I'm terrified. You know I'd better go inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.90,0:59:42.27,ENG,774,0,0,0,,But don't feel bad, Princess. I used to be afraid of the dark, too, until...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.34,0:59:45.10,ENG,775,0,0,0,,Hey, no, wait. I'm still afraid of the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.18,0:59:47.74,ENG,776,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.41,0:59:49.67,ENG,777,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.69,0:59:57.45,ENG,778,0,0,0,,I really see what's going on
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.52,0:59:59.46,ENG,779,0,0,0,,Oh, what are you talkin' about?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.52,1:00:02.29,ENG,780,0,0,0,,I don't even wanna hear it. Look, I'm an animal, and I got instincts.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.36,1:00:04.79,ENG,781,0,0,0,,I know that you two are diggin' on each other. I could feel it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.86,1:00:07.70,ENG,782,0,0,0,,Oh, you're crazy. I'm just bringing her back to Farquaad.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.77,1:00:11.13,ENG,783,0,0,0,,Oh, come on, Shrek. Wake up and smell the pheromones.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.20,1:00:12.86,ENG,784,0,0,0,,Just go in and tell her how you feel
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.94,1:00:17.97,ENG,785,0,0,0,,There's nothing to tell. Besides, even if I did tell her that,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.04,1:00:19.94,ENG,786,0,0,0,,well you know...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.04,1:00:23.54,ENG,787,0,0,0,,and I'm not sayin' that I do 'cause I don't...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.62,1:00:26.05,ENG,788,0,0,0,,she's a princess and I'm...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.12,1:00:27.81,ENG,789,0,0,0,,An ogre?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.89,1:00:31.55,ENG,790,0,0,0,,Yeah. An ogre.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.62,1:00:35.68,ENG,791,0,0,0,,- Hey, where are you goin'? - To get... more firewood.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.95,1:00:56.64,ENG,792,0,0,0,,Princess?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.71,1:00:59.41,ENG,793,0,0,0,,Princess Fiona?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.66,1:01:06.52,ENG,794,0,0,0,,Princess, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.76,1:01:14.25,ENG,795,0,0,0,,Princess?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.34,1:01:20.10,ENG,796,0,0,0,,It's very spooky in here. I ain't playing no games.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.32,1:01:32.75,ENG,797,0,0,0,,- Oh, no! - No, help!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.82,1:01:35.91,ENG,798,0,0,0,,- Shh! - Shrek! Shrek! Shrek! - No, it's okay. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.99,1:01:38.89,ENG,799,0,0,0,,- What did you do with the princess? - Donkey, shhh, I'm the princess.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.96,1:01:41.72,ENG,800,0,0,0,,It's me, in this body.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.79,1:01:44.35,ENG,801,0,0,0,,Oh, my God! You ate the princess!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.43,1:01:46.36,ENG,802,0,0,0,,- Can you hear me? - Donkey!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.43,1:01:48.76,ENG,803,0,0,0,,- Listen, keep breathing! I'll get you out of there! - No!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.83,1:01:51.30,ENG,804,0,0,0,,- Shrek! Shrek! Shrek! - Shh.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.37,1:01:53.23,ENG,805,0,0,0,,- Shrek! - This is me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.34,1:02:01.24,ENG,806,0,0,0,,Princess?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.31,1:02:04.80,ENG,807,0,0,0,,What happened to you? You're, uh, uh,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.88,1:02:06.82,ENG,808,0,0,0,,uh, different.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.88,1:02:09.15,ENG,809,0,0,0,,- I'm ugly, okay? - Well, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.22,1:02:12.38,ENG,810,0,0,0,,Was it something that you ate? 'Cause I told Shrek those rats was a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.46,1:02:14.98,ENG,811,0,0,0,,- You are what you eat, I said. Now... - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.06,1:02:18.43,ENG,812,0,0,0,,I... I've been this way as long as I can remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.50,1:02:20.96,ENG,813,0,0,0,,What do you mean? Look, I ain't never seen you like this before.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.03,1:02:24.20,ENG,814,0,0,0,,It only happens when the sun goes down.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.64,1:02:29.23,ENG,815,0,0,0,,"By night one way, by day another.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.34,1:02:31.40,ENG,816,0,0,0,,"This shall be the norm...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.48,1:02:34.60,ENG,817,0,0,0,,"until you find true love's first kiss...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.68,1:02:39.12,ENG,818,0,0,0,,and then, take love's true form. "
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.18,1:02:42.74,ENG,819,0,0,0,,Ah, that's beautiful. I didn't know you wrote poetry.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.82,1:02:44.75,ENG,820,0,0,0,,It's a spell.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.82,1:02:47.42,ENG,821,0,0,0,,When I was a little girl,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.49,1:02:50.15,ENG,822,0,0,0,,a witch cast a spell on me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.23,1:02:52.79,ENG,823,0,0,0,,Every night I become this.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.86,1:02:56.53,ENG,824,0,0,0,,This horrible, ugly beast!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.04,1:03:04.10,ENG,825,0,0,0,,I was placed in a tower to await the day my true love would rescue me.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.18,1:03:06.74,ENG,826,0,0,0,,That's why I have to marry lord Farquaad tomorrow...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.84,1:03:10.25,ENG,827,0,0,0,,before the sun sets and he sees me...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.52,1:03:14.49,ENG,828,0,0,0,,like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.55,1:03:17.82,ENG,829,0,0,0,,All right, all right. Calm down. Look, it's not that bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.89,1:03:22.05,ENG,830,0,0,0,,You're not that ugly. Well, I ain't gonna lie. You are ugly.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.13,1:03:25.15,ENG,831,0,0,0,,But you only look like this at night. Shrek's ugly 24-7.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.23,1:03:28.63,ENG,832,0,0,0,,But Donkey, I'm a princess,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.70,1:03:32.29,ENG,833,0,0,0,,and this is not how a princess is meant to look.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.37,1:03:36.14,ENG,834,0,0,0,,Princess, how 'bout if you don't marry Farquaad?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.21,1:03:38.14,ENG,835,0,0,0,,I have to.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.21,1:03:41.04,ENG,836,0,0,0,,Only my true love's kiss can brake the spell.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.11,1:03:44.67,ENG,837,0,0,0,,But you know, you're kind of an ogre,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.75,1:03:48.19,ENG,838,0,0,0,,and Shrek...  well, you've got a lot in common.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.25,1:03:49.74,ENG,839,0,0,0,,Shrek?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.82,1:03:53.66,ENG,840,0,0,0,,Princess, I... Uh, how's it going, first of all?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.76,1:03:56.56,ENG,841,0,0,0,,Good? Um, good for me too.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.63,1:03:58.56,ENG,842,0,0,0,,I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.63,1:04:03.53,ENG,843,0,0,0,,I saw this flower and thought of you because it's pretty and...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.60,1:04:07.87,ENG,844,0,0,0,,well, I don't really like it, but I thought you may like it, 'cause you're pretty.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.94,1:04:11.17,ENG,845,0,0,0,,But I like you anyway. I'd...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.31,1:04:16.87,ENG,846,0,0,0,,I'm in trouble. Okay, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.95,1:04:19.44,ENG,847,0,0,0,,I can't just marry whoever I want.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.52,1:04:21.82,ENG,848,0,0,0,,Take a good look at me, Donkey.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.92,1:04:23.85,ENG,849,0,0,0,,I mean, really,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.92,1:04:26.58,ENG,850,0,0,0,,who could ever love a beast so hideous and hugly?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.66,1:04:29.09,ENG,851,0,0,0,,"Princess" and "ugly" don't go together.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.16,1:04:31.59,ENG,852,0,0,0,,That's why I can't stay here with Shrek.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.66,1:04:36.10,ENG,853,0,0,0,,My only chance to live happily ever after is to marry my true love.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.17,1:04:39.60,ENG,854,0,0,0,,Don't you see, Donkey?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.67,1:04:42.97,ENG,855,0,0,0,,That's just how it has to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.04,1:04:46.10,ENG,856,0,0,0,,It's the only way to break the spell.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.18,1:04:48.94,ENG,857,0,0,0,,- You at least gotta tell Shrek the truth. - No!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.01,1:04:51.95,ENG,858,0,0,0,,You can't breathe the word. No one must ever know.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.02,1:04:54.14,ENG,859,0,0,0,,What's the point of being able to talk if you gotta keep secrets?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.22,1:04:57.38,ENG,860,0,0,0,,Promise you won't tell. Promise!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.46,1:05:00.55,ENG,861,0,0,0,,All right, all right. I won't tell him. But you should.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.63,1:05:03.62,ENG,862,0,0,0,,I just know, before this is over, I'm gonna need a whole lot of serious therapy.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.69,1:05:07.22,ENG,863,0,0,0,,Look at my eye twitchin'.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.92,1:05:33.69,ENG,864,0,0,0,,I tell him, I tell him not.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.06,1:05:38.15,ENG,865,0,0,0,,I tell him, I tell him not.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.23,1:05:40.16,ENG,866,0,0,0,,I tell him.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.23,1:05:42.32,ENG,867,0,0,0,,Shrek!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.40,1:05:44.96,ENG,868,0,0,0,,Shrek, there's something I want...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.76,1:06:07.95,ENG,869,0,0,0,,Shrek.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.39,1:06:11.45,ENG,870,0,0,0,,- Are you all right? - Perfect!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.53,1:06:13.50,ENG,871,0,0,0,,Never been better.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.56,1:06:16.86,ENG,872,0,0,0,,I... I don't...  There's something I have to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.93,1:06:19.49,ENG,873,0,0,0,,You don't have to tell me anything, Princess.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.57,1:06:21.66,ENG,874,0,0,0,,- I heard enough last night. - You heard what I said?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.74,1:06:23.67,ENG,875,0,0,0,,Every word.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.74,1:06:25.90,ENG,876,0,0,0,,I thought you'd understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.98,1:06:27.91,ENG,877,0,0,0,,Oh, I understand!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.98,1:06:31.57,ENG,878,0,0,0,,Like you said, "Who could love a hideous, ugly beast?"
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.65,1:06:34.35,ENG,879,0,0,0,,But I thought that wouldn't matter to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.42,1:06:36.18,ENG,880,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, it does.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.76,1:06:40.99,ENG,881,0,0,0,,Ah, right on time.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.06,1:06:43.93,ENG,882,0,0,0,,Princess, I brought you a little something.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.33,1:06:52.00,ENG,883,0,0,0,,What'd I miss? What'd I miss?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.10,1:06:54.73,ENG,884,0,0,0,,Who said that? Couldn't have been a donkey.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.11,1:06:58.58,ENG,885,0,0,0,,Princess Fiona.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.64,1:07:01.34,ENG,886,0,0,0,,As promised. Now hand it over.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.45,1:07:05.71,ENG,887,0,0,0,,Very well, ogre. The deed to your swamp, cleared out as agreed.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.78,1:07:10.35,ENG,888,0,0,0,,Take it and go before I change my mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.42,1:07:13.25,ENG,889,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Princess, for startling you,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.32,1:07:15.26,ENG,890,0,0,0,,but you startled me,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.33,1:07:19.02,ENG,891,0,0,0,,For I've never seen such a radiant beauty before.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.10,1:07:22.09,ENG,892,0,0,0,,I am lord Farquaad.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.17,1:07:26.07,ENG,893,0,0,0,,Lord Farquaad? Oh, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.14,1:07:29.11,ENG,894,0,0,0,,Forgive me, my lord, for I was just saying...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.17,1:07:34.63,ENG,895,0,0,0,,a short... farewell.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.71,1:07:39.38,ENG,896,0,0,0,,That is so sweet. You don't have to raise good manners on the ogre.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.45,1:07:41.38,ENG,897,0,0,0,,It's not like it has feelings.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.45,1:07:45.41,ENG,898,0,0,0,,No. You're right. It doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.49,1:07:49.48,ENG,899,0,0,0,,Princess Fiona, beautiful fair flawless Fiona.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.56,1:07:52.59,ENG,900,0,0,0,,I ask your hand in marriage.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.66,1:07:57.69,ENG,901,0,0,0,,Will you be the perfect bride for the perfect groom?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.01,1:08:06.17,ENG,902,0,0,0,,Lord Farquaad, I accept. Nothing would make...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.24,1:08:09.44,ENG,903,0,0,0,,Excellent! I'll start the plans for tomorrow we wed!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.51,1:08:11.45,ENG,904,0,0,0,,No! I mean, uh,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.52,1:08:13.92,ENG,905,0,0,0,,Why wait?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.98,1:08:17.82,ENG,906,0,0,0,,Let's get married today before the sun sets.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.89,1:08:20.58,ENG,907,0,0,0,,Oh, anxious, are we? You're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.69,1:08:24.63,ENG,908,0,0,0,,The sooner, the better. There's so much to do!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.70,1:08:27.03,ENG,909,0,0,0,,There is the caterer, the cake, the band, the guest list.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.10,1:08:30.12,ENG,910,0,0,0,,Captain, round up some guests.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.20,1:08:32.93,ENG,911,0,0,0,,Fare-thee-well, ogre.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.00,1:08:35.60,ENG,912,0,0,0,,Shrek, what are you doing? You let her get away.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.67,1:08:38.37,ENG,913,0,0,0,,- Yeah? So what? - Shrek, there's something about her you don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.44,1:08:40.88,ENG,914,0,0,0,,Look, I talked to her last night. She's
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.95,1:08:45.01,ENG,915,0,0,0,,Yeah I know you talked to her last night. You're great pals, aren't ya?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.08,1:08:48.85,ENG,916,0,0,0,,Now, if you two are such good friends, why didn't you follow her home?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.92,1:08:50.89,ENG,917,0,0,0,,Shrek, I wanna go with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.96,1:08:53.95,ENG,918,0,0,0,,I told you, didn't I? You're not coming home with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.02,1:08:57.98,ENG,919,0,0,0,,I live alone! My swamp! Me! Nobody else!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.06,1:09:00.16,ENG,920,0,0,0,,Understand? Nobody!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.23,1:09:05.07,ENG,921,0,0,0,,Especially useless, pathetic, annoying, talking donkeys!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.14,1:09:08.33,ENG,922,0,0,0,,- But. I thought...  - Yeah. You know what?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.41,1:09:10.60,ENG,923,0,0,0,,You thought wrong!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.38,1:09:14.28,ENG,924,0,0,0,,Shrek.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.75,1:11:36.78,ENG,925,0,0,0,,Donkey?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.85,1:11:39.05,ENG,926,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.12,1:11:42.12,ENG,927,0,0,0,,I would think, of all the people, you would recognize a wall when you see one.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.19,1:11:44.13,ENG,928,0,0,0,,Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.19,1:11:47.56,ENG,929,0,0,0,,But the wall's supposed to go around my swamp, not through it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.63,1:11:50.46,ENG,930,0,0,0,,It is around your half. See, that's your half, and this is my half.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.53,1:11:53.13,ENG,931,0,0,0,,Oh, your half? Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.20,1:11:55.73,ENG,932,0,0,0,,Yes, my half. I helped rescue the princess.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.81,1:11:58.07,ENG,933,0,0,0,,I did half the work, I get half the booty.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.14,1:12:01.51,ENG,934,0,0,0,,Now hand me that big old rock, the one that looks like your head.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.58,1:12:03.91,ENG,935,0,0,0,,- Back off! - No, you back off.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.98,1:12:06.01,ENG,936,0,0,0,,- This is my swamp! - Our swamp.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.08,1:12:08.02,ENG,937,0,0,0,,- Let go, Donkey! - You let go.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.09,1:12:10.05,ENG,938,0,0,0,,- Stubborn jackass! - Smelly ogre.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.12,1:12:12.35,ENG,939,0,0,0,,Fine!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.42,1:12:15.76,ENG,940,0,0,0,,- Hey, hey, come back here. I'm not through with you yet. - Well, I'm through with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.83,1:12:19.09,ENG,941,0,0,0,,Uh...uh. Well, you know, with you it's always, "Me, me, me!"
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.16,1:12:21.76,ENG,942,0,0,0,,Well, guess what! Now it's my turn!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.83,1:12:23.99,ENG,943,0,0,0,,So you just shut up and pay attention!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.07,1:12:26.04,ENG,944,0,0,0,,You are mean to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.10,1:12:28.59,ENG,945,0,0,0,,You insult me and you don't appreciate anything that I do!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.67,1:12:31.77,ENG,946,0,0,0,,You're always pushing me around or pushing me away.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.84,1:12:35.71,ENG,947,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah? Well, if I treated you so bad, how come you came back?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.78,1:12:39.01,ENG,948,0,0,0,,Because that's what friend do! They forgive each other!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.08,1:12:42.28,ENG,949,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. You're right, Donkey.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.35,1:12:46.59,ENG,950,0,0,0,,I forgive you... for stabbin' me in the back!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.66,1:12:52.10,ENG,951,0,0,0,,Ohh! You're so wrapped up in layers, onion boy, you're afraid of your own feelings.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.16,1:12:55.62,ENG,952,0,0,0,,- Go away! - There you are, doing it again just like you did to Fiona.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.70,1:12:58.29,ENG,953,0,0,0,,And all she ever do was like you, maybe even love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.37,1:13:02.53,ENG,954,0,0,0,,Love me? She said I was ugly, a hideous creature.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.61,1:13:04.54,ENG,955,0,0,0,,I heard the two of youtalking.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.61,1:13:06.54,ENG,956,0,0,0,,She wasn't talking about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.61,1:13:08.94,ENG,957,0,0,0,,She was talking about, uh, somebody else.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.48,1:13:13.92,ENG,958,0,0,0,,She wasn't talking about me?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.98,1:13:16.28,ENG,959,0,0,0,,Well, then who was she talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.35,1:13:19.08,ENG,960,0,0,0,,Uh...uh, no way. I ain't saying anything. You don't wanna listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.16,1:13:21.45,ENG,961,0,0,0,,- Right? Right? - Donkey!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.53,1:13:22.25,ENG,962,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.16,1:13:26.06,ENG,963,0,0,0,,Okay, look. I'm sorry, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.57,1:13:34.60,ENG,964,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.67,1:13:38.90,ENG,965,0,0,0,,I guess I am just a big, stupid, ugly ogre.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.14,1:13:42.08,ENG,966,0,0,0,,Can you forgive me?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.31,1:13:46.25,ENG,967,0,0,0,,Hey, that's the friends are for, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.32,1:13:48.98,ENG,968,0,0,0,,Right. Friends?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.05,1:13:50.99,ENG,969,0,0,0,,Friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.06,1:13:54.02,ENG,970,0,0,0,,So, um,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.09,1:13:56.36,ENG,971,0,0,0,,what did Fiona say about me?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.43,1:13:59.59,ENG,972,0,0,0,,What are you asking me for? Why don't you just go ask her?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.66,1:14:02.66,ENG,973,0,0,0,,The wedding! We'll never make it in time.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.73,1:14:06.46,ENG,974,0,0,0,,Never fear, for where there's a will, there's a way.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.54,1:14:08.16,ENG,975,0,0,0,,And I have a way.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.54,1:14:13.71,ENG,976,0,0,0,,Donkey?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.08,1:14:17.48,ENG,977,0,0,0,,I guess this is just my animal magnetism.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.55,1:14:20.71,ENG,978,0,0,0,,Aw, come here, you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.78,1:14:23.62,ENG,979,0,0,0,,All right, all right. Don't get all slobbery. No one likes a kiss ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.69,1:14:26.21,ENG,980,0,0,0,,All right, hop on and hold on tight.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.29,1:14:29.78,ENG,981,0,0,0,,I hadn't have a chance to install seat belts yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.46,1:15:04.02,ENG,982,0,0,0,,People of DuLoc,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.09,1:15:06.76,ENG,983,0,0,0,,we gather here today...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.83,1:15:08.89,ENG,984,0,0,0,,to bear witness...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.97,1:15:10.90,ENG,985,0,0,0,,to the union...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.97,1:15:13.44,ENG,986,0,0,0,,- of our new king  - Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.50,1:15:16.20,ENG,987,0,0,0,,Could we just skip ahead to the "I do's"?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.27,1:15:18.17,ENG,988,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.25,1:15:26.84,ENG,989,0,0,0,,Go ahead, have some fun. If we need you, I'll whisle. How about that?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.49,1:15:31.42,ENG,990,0,0,0,,Shrek, wait, wait! Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.49,1:15:34.18,ENG,991,0,0,0,,- You want to do this right, don't you? - What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.26,1:15:36.19,ENG,992,0,0,0,,There's a line, There's a line you gotta wait for.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.26,1:15:38.75,ENG,993,0,0,0,,The preacher's gonna say, "Speak now or forever hold your peace. "
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.83,1:15:42.60,ENG,994,0,0,0,,- That's when you say, "I object!" - I don't have time for this!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.67,1:15:44.40,ENG,995,0,0,0,,Wait, wait. What are you doing? Listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.47,1:15:46.40,ENG,996,0,0,0,,- Look, you love this woman, don't you? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.47,1:15:47.77,ENG,997,0,0,0,,- You wanna hold her? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.84,1:15:49.60,ENG,998,0,0,0,,- Please her? - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.64,1:15:52.77,ENG,999,0,0,0,,Then you got to, got to try a little tenderness
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.84,1:15:55.61,ENG,1000,0,0,0,,- The chicks love that romantic crap! - All right! Cut it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.68,1:15:59.31,ENG,1001,0,0,0,,- When does this guy say the line? - We gotta check it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.38,1:16:02.55,ENG,1002,0,0,0,,And so, by the power vested in me,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.65,1:16:05.92,ENG,1003,0,0,0,,- What do you see? - The whole town's in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.99,1:16:09.12,ENG,1004,0,0,0,,- I know pronounce you husband and wife, - They're at the altar.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.19,1:16:11.75,ENG,1005,0,0,0,,- king and queen. - Mother Fletcher! He already said it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.83,1:16:14.46,ENG,1006,0,0,0,,for the love of Pete!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.70,1:16:17.76,ENG,1007,0,0,0,,I object!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.83,1:16:19.93,ENG,1008,0,0,0,,Shrek?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.00,1:16:21.94,ENG,1009,0,0,0,,Oh, now what does he want?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.51,1:16:28.57,ENG,1010,0,0,0,,Hi, everyone. Havin' a good time, are ya?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.65,1:16:30.84,ENG,1011,0,0,0,,I love DuLoc, first of all.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.91,1:16:33.44,ENG,1012,0,0,0,,- Very clean. - What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.52,1:16:36.45,ENG,1013,0,0,0,,Really, it's rude enough being alive when no one wants you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.52,1:16:39.85,ENG,1014,0,0,0,,- But showing up uninvited to a wedding - Fiona!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.92,1:16:42.95,ENG,1015,0,0,0,,- I need to talk to you. - Oh, now you wanna talk?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.03,1:16:46.00,ENG,1016,0,0,0,,Well, it's a little late for that, so if you'll excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.06,1:16:48.43,ENG,1017,0,0,0,,- But you can't marry him. - And why not?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.53,1:16:52.43,ENG,1018,0,0,0,,Because... Because he's just marrying you so he can be king.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.50,1:16:54.87,ENG,1019,0,0,0,,Outrageous! Fiona, don't listen to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.94,1:16:58.60,ENG,1020,0,0,0,,- He's not your true love. - And what do you know about true love?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.68,1:17:01.04,ENG,1021,0,0,0,,Well, I... Uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.11,1:17:04.51,ENG,1022,0,0,0,,- I mean... - Oh, this is precious.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.88,1:17:09.25,ENG,1023,0,0,0,,the ogre has fallen in love with the princess!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.35,1:17:11.62,ENG,1024,0,0,0,,Oh, good Lord.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.69,1:17:13.62,ENG,1025,0,0,0,,An ogre and a princess!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.23,1:17:21.72,ENG,1026,0,0,0,,Shrek, is this true?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.73,1:17:25.69,ENG,1027,0,0,0,,Who cares? It's preposterous!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.77,1:17:29.40,ENG,1028,0,0,0,,Fiona, my love, we're but a kiss away for our "happily ever after. "
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.47,1:17:31.07,ENG,1029,0,0,0,,Now kiss me! Mmmm!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.15,1:17:39.48,ENG,1030,0,0,0,,"By night one way, by day another. "
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.42,1:17:44.15,ENG,1031,0,0,0,,I wanted to show you before.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.35,1:18:11.37,ENG,1032,0,0,0,,that explains a lot.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.95,1:18:15.11,ENG,1033,0,0,0,,Ugh! It's disgusting!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.19,1:18:17.24,ENG,1034,0,0,0,,Guards! Guards!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.32,1:18:20.52,ENG,1035,0,0,0,,I order you to get that out of my sight now! Get them!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.59,1:18:23.39,ENG,1036,0,0,0,,- Get them both! - No, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.46,1:18:27.23,ENG,1037,0,0,0,,This hocus-pocus alters nothing. This marriage is binding, and that makes me king!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.30,1:18:29.60,ENG,1038,0,0,0,,- See? See? - No, let go of me! Shrek!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.67,1:18:31.40,ENG,1039,0,0,0,,No! Don't just stand there, you morons.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.47,1:18:33.99,ENG,1040,0,0,0,,Get out of my way! Fiona!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.28,1:18:42.27,ENG,1041,0,0,0,,I'll make you regret the day we met. I'll see you drawn and quartered!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.35,1:18:45.28,ENG,1042,0,0,0,,- You'll beg for death to save you! - No! Shrek!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.35,1:18:48.88,ENG,1043,0,0,0,,- And as for you, my wife. - Fiona!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.95,1:18:51.61,ENG,1044,0,0,0,,I'll have you locked back in that tower for the rest of your days!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.69,1:18:53.52,ENG,1045,0,0,0,,I am king!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.62,1:18:57.39,ENG,1046,0,0,0,,I will have order! I will have perfection! I will have...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.83,1:19:04.60,ENG,1047,0,0,0,,- Aah! - All right. Nobody move.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.67,1:19:06.76,ENG,1048,0,0,0,,I got a dragon here, and I'm not afraid to use it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.84,1:19:10.07,ENG,1049,0,0,0,,I'm a donkey on the edge!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.14,1:19:16.58,ENG,1050,0,0,0,,Celebrity marriages. They never last, do they?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.72,1:19:20.55,ENG,1051,0,0,0,,Go ahead Shrek.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.92,1:19:24.22,ENG,1052,0,0,0,,Uh, Fiona?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.36,1:19:27.59,ENG,1053,0,0,0,,Yes, Shrek?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.66,1:19:31.68,ENG,1054,0,0,0,,I... I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.76,1:19:34.03,ENG,1055,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.10,1:19:38.12,ENG,1056,0,0,0,,Really, really.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.20,1:19:40.10,ENG,1057,0,0,0,,I love you too.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.18,1:19:52.44,ENG,1058,0,0,0,,"Until you find true love's first kiss...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.52,1:19:55.78,ENG,1059,0,0,0,,and then take love's true form. "
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.38,1:20:22.28,ENG,1060,0,0,0,,"Take love's true form. Take love's true form. "
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.45,1:20:30.94,ENG,1061,0,0,0,,Fiona?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.46,1:20:36.05,ENG,1062,0,0,0,,Fiona.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.13,1:20:38.69,ENG,1063,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.76,1:20:40.70,ENG,1064,0,0,0,,Well, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.76,1:20:44.03,ENG,1065,0,0,0,,But I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.10,1:20:46.23,ENG,1066,0,0,0,,I'm supposed to be beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.94,1:20:51.20,ENG,1067,0,0,0,,But you are beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.81,1:20:56.18,ENG,1068,0,0,0,,I was hoping this would be a happy ending.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.02,1:21:04.45,ENG,1069,0,0,0,,I thought love was only true in fairy tales
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.06,1:21:09.79,ENG,1070,0,0,0,,Meant for someone else but not for me
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.20,1:21:15.16,ENG,1071,0,0,0,,Love was out to get me
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.23,1:21:18.07,ENG,1072,0,0,0,,That's the way it seemed
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.13,1:21:22.59,ENG,1073,0,0,0,,Disappointment haunted all my dreams
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.67,1:21:25.97,ENG,1074,0,0,0,,And then I saw her face
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.04,1:21:28.84,ENG,1075,0,0,0,,Now I'm a believer
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.91,1:21:34.38,ENG,1076,0,0,0,,And not a trace Of doubt in my mind
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.38,1:21:38.45,ENG,1077,0,0,0,,I'm in love
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.52,1:21:40.99,ENG,1078,0,0,0,,I'm a believer I couldn't leave her
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.06,1:21:43.29,ENG,1079,0,0,0,,If I tried
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.36,1:21:47.42,ENG,1080,0,0,0,,God bless us, every one.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.50,1:21:51.02,ENG,1081,0,0,0,,- Come on  - Then I saw her face
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.10,1:21:54.26,ENG,1082,0,0,0,,Now I'm a believer
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.34,1:21:57.10,ENG,1083,0,0,0,,Not a trace
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.21,1:22:00.01,ENG,1084,0,0,0,,Of doubt in my mind
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.08,1:22:03.34,ENG,1085,0,0,0,,I'm in love
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.41,1:22:07.68,ENG,1086,0,0,0,,I'm a believer I couldn't leave her if I tried
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.69,1:22:13.28,ENG,1087,0,0,0,,Then I saw her face
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.36,1:22:16.33,ENG,1088,0,0,0,,Now I'm a believer
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.39,1:22:19.19,ENG,1089,0,0,0,,Not a trace
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.26,1:22:22.53,ENG,1090,0,0,0,,Of doubt in my mind
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.60,1:22:27.16,ENG,1091,0,0,0,,I'm in love I'm a believer
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.24,1:22:29.10,ENG,1092,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.17,1:22:31.11,ENG,1093,0,0,0,,I believe, I believe I believe, I believe
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.17,1:22:33.84,ENG,1094,0,0,0,,I believe, I believe I believe, I believe, I believe, hey
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.91,1:22:36.50,ENG,1095,0,0,0,,Y'all sing it with me!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.58,1:22:38.28,ENG,1096,0,0,0,,Believe
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.35,1:22:41.32,ENG,1097,0,0,0,,I believe
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.38,1:22:44.32,ENG,1098,0,0,0,,I believe
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.39,1:22:47.36,ENG,1099,0,0,0,,I'm a believer
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.42,1:22:50.33,ENG,1100,0,0,0,,I believe
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.39,1:22:54.83,ENG,1101,0,0,0,,I believe
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.23,1:22:59.50,ENG,1102,0,0,0,,Oh, that's funny. Oh. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.57,1:23:02.13,ENG,1103,0,0,0,,I can't breathe. I can't breathe.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.11,1:23:05.40,ENG,1104,0,0,0,,I believe in self-assertion
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.48,1:23:07.67,ENG,1105,0,0,0,,Destiny or a slight divertion
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.74,1:23:12.04,ENG,1106,0,0,0,,Now it seems I've got my head on straight
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.12,1:23:14.24,ENG,1107,0,0,0,,I'm freak an apparition
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.80,0:00:52.67,CHS,1,0,0,0,,从前有一位可爱的公主
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.74,0:00:56.50,CHS,2,0,0,0,,但是她被可怕的魔法控制了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.58,0:01:01.48,CHS,3,0,0,0,,只有真爱的初吻才可以解除这魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.55,0:01:03.91,CHS,4,0,0,0,,她被困在一个城堡里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.98,0:01:08.18,CHS,5,0,0,0,,由一只喷火龙看守着
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.25,0:01:12.66,CHS,6,0,0,0,,有许多勇敢的骑士曾经想 把她从这可怕的监狱中救走
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.73,0:01:15.49,CHS,7,0,0,0,,但是  没有一个成功
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.56,0:01:17.76,CHS,8,0,0,0,,她关在被喷火龙看守着的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.83,0:01:20.77,CHS,9,0,0,0,,城堡里最高的房间里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.83,0:01:25.36,CHS,10,0,0,0,,等待着真爱的初吻
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.44,0:01:28.43,CHS,11,0,0,0,,那是不会发生的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.44,0:01:53.43,CHS,12,0,0,0,,《怪物史瑞克》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.47,0:03:40.73,CHS,13,0,0,0,,- 我想它在里面  - 我们去吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.81,0:03:43.57,CHS,14,0,0,0,,慢着!你知道会发生什么吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.64,0:03:46.61,CHS,15,0,0,0,,它会把你的骨头当面包吃
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.68,0:03:50.64,CHS,16,0,0,0,,其实那是一个巨人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.72,0:03:54.78,CHS,17,0,0,0,,不过  更糟糕的可能是个怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.85,0:03:57.75,CHS,18,0,0,0,,它们会扒下你们新鲜的皮肤做汤
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.86,0:03:59.95,CHS,19,0,0,0,,挖出你的心肝
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.03,0:04:03.29,CHS,20,0,0,0,,用你的眼睛榨果汁
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.36,0:04:05.92,CHS,21,0,0,0,,- 这样吃吐司面包味道会很好  - 退后  退后  怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.00,0:04:08.09,CHS,22,0,0,0,,我警告你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.25,0:04:33.82,CHS,23,0,0,0,,你们还不快走就没有机会了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.60,0:04:43.63,CHS,24,0,0,0,,滚吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.54,0:04:48.60,CHS,25,0,0,0,,通缉:童话人物
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.05,0:04:56.45,CHS,26,0,0,0,,好的  这车满了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.65,0:04:59.21,CHS,27,0,0,0,,拉走
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.28,0:05:03.19,CHS,28,0,0,0,,- 走  快点  快点   - 下一个
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.26,0:05:06.19,CHS,29,0,0,0,,给我  你飞行的日子要结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.26,0:05:08.89,CHS,30,0,0,0,,这是给你的20银币  下一个!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.96,0:05:11.69,CHS,31,0,0,0,,起来  快点
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.23,0:05:16.72,CHS,32,0,0,0,,安静点!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.80,0:05:19.70,CHS,33,0,0,0,,笼子太小了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.77,0:05:21.86,CHS,34,0,0,0,,请不要让我进去  我不再顽固了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.94,0:05:23.93,CHS,35,0,0,0,,我会改的  再给我一次机会
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.01,0:05:26.41,CHS,36,0,0,0,,闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.48,0:05:29.38,CHS,37,0,0,0,,- 下一个  什么东西  - 这是一个小木偶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.45,0:05:34.39,CHS,38,0,0,0,,我不是木偶  我是一个真正的男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.45,0:05:36.82,CHS,39,0,0,0,,5先令给你这个疯狂的玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.92,0:05:39.02,CHS,40,0,0,0,,拿走
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.09,0:05:40.99,CHS,41,0,0,0,,下一个  什么东西?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.09,0:05:43.72,CHS,42,0,0,0,,我有一头会说话的驴子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.80,0:05:48.32,CHS,43,0,0,0,,好的  如果你能证明  我给你十先令
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.43,0:05:52.37,CHS,44,0,0,0,,好的  说吧  伙计
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.44,0:05:57.14,CHS,45,0,0,0,,哦  它只是有点紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.21,0:06:01.20,CHS,46,0,0,0,,它可是个话匣子呀  说话啊!你这头蠢驴!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.28,0:06:03.87,CHS,47,0,0,0,,- 好了  我听够了  守卫! - 不  不  它能说话
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.95,0:06:08.08,CHS,48,0,0,0,,我能说话  我爱说话
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.15,0:06:11.09,CHS,49,0,0,0,,我是你见过的最能说话的驴子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.16,0:06:13.72,CHS,50,0,0,0,,- 把她带走   - 不  不要
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.79,0:06:18.23,CHS,51,0,0,0,,我发誓  它能说话
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.53,0:06:22.93,CHS,52,0,0,0,,嘿  我会飞!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.00,0:06:24.63,CHS,53,0,0,0,,- 它会飞  - 会飞!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.70,0:06:27.76,CHS,54,0,0,0,,它说话了  对了  笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.84,0:06:30.10,CHS,55,0,0,0,,对  现在我是会飞会说话的驴子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.18,0:06:32.80,CHS,56,0,0,0,,你可能看过蝇子  而且是一个很大的蝇子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.88,0:06:35.94,CHS,57,0,0,0,,不过你肯定没有看过会飞的驴子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.32,0:06:44.26,CHS,58,0,0,0,,抓住它
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.90,0:07:00.10,CHS,59,0,0,0,,在这边  快过来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.34,0:07:07.64,CHS,60,0,0,0,,是你  怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.71,0:07:10.01,CHS,61,0,0,0,,什么事?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.08,0:07:14.18,CHS,62,0,0,0,,奉弗瓜王之命  授权我逮捕你们两个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.25,0:07:19.85,CHS,63,0,0,0,,送到一个指定地...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.93,0:07:23.95,CHS,64,0,0,0,,是吗?你和什么军队?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.74,0:07:36.73,CHS,65,0,0,0,,我可以跟你说话吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.81,0:07:40.18,CHS,66,0,0,0,,听着  你的确有些本领  了不起!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.25,0:07:46.01,CHS,67,0,0,0,,你在跟我说话吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.08,0:07:50.04,CHS,68,0,0,0,,是的  我在跟你说话  你刚才真的很厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.12,0:07:52.85,CHS,69,0,0,0,,那些侍卫以为自己很棒  然后你一出现  砰!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.92,0:07:54.89,CHS,70,0,0,0,,都跑光了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.96,0:07:56.89,CHS,71,0,0,0,,我看了感觉很爽
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.96,0:08:00.02,CHS,72,0,0,0,,- 很棒  真的   - 获得自由的感觉真好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.10,0:08:05.66,CHS,73,0,0,0,,去跟你的朋友庆祝你的自由吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.74,0:08:09.04,CHS,74,0,0,0,,可是我没有朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.11,0:08:11.77,CHS,75,0,0,0,,我也不会单独出去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.84,0:08:14.40,CHS,76,0,0,0,,嘿  等等  我有一个很好的建议  我跟着你好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.48,0:08:16.41,CHS,77,0,0,0,,你是一个令人恐惧的绿色怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.48,0:08:18.68,CHS,78,0,0,0,,遇到我们的人会被我们一起吓跑
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.09,0:08:25.75,CHS,79,0,0,0,,噢  真吓人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.82,0:08:29.56,CHS,80,0,0,0,,这很可怕  如果不管用  你呼口气就可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.63,0:08:32.76,CHS,81,0,0,0,,你需要些口香糖  你有点口臭
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.83,0:08:36.06,CHS,82,0,0,0,,你几乎把我的鼻毛都烧着了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.13,0:08:38.97,CHS,83,0,0,0,,就像那次...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.04,0:08:42.77,CHS,84,0,0,0,,...我吃了一些烂草莓后放了很多屁
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.84,0:08:45.54,CHS,85,0,0,0,,你为什么跟着我?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.68,0:08:49.24,CHS,86,0,0,0,,我告诉你原因
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.31,0:08:52.25,CHS,87,0,0,0,,因为我寂寞
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.32,0:08:56.08,CHS,88,0,0,0,,没有人陪我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.15,0:08:59.82,CHS,89,0,0,0,,我的烦恼都走开
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.89,0:09:03.26,CHS,90,0,0,0,,没有人会嘲笑我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.33,0:09:05.30,CHS,91,0,0,0,,当你有了朋友...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.36,0:09:08.42,CHS,92,0,0,0,,别唱了!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.50,0:09:10.56,CHS,93,0,0,0,,怪不得你没有朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.64,0:09:14.26,CHS,94,0,0,0,,噢  只有真正的朋友才会这么诚实
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.34,0:09:18.40,CHS,95,0,0,0,,听着  驴子  看看我  我是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.32,0:09:26.58,CHS,96,0,0,0,,- 真高?  - 不!我是个怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.65,0:09:29.85,CHS,97,0,0,0,,想像一下:拿着你的火把和草杈!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.92,0:09:31.95,CHS,98,0,0,0,,这不让你烦恼吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.02,0:09:34.15,CHS,99,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.23,0:09:37.13,CHS,100,0,0,0,,- 真的?  - 真的  真的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.20,0:09:40.32,CHS,101,0,0,0,,我喜欢你  你叫什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.40,0:09:44.10,CHS,102,0,0,0,,史莱克
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.17,0:09:47.43,CHS,103,0,0,0,,史莱克?知道我喜欢你什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.51,0:09:50.57,CHS,104,0,0,0,,你不在乎别人怎么看自己
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.61,0:09:54.07,CHS,105,0,0,0,,我喜欢这个  我敬佩这个  史莱克
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.51,0:09:59.51,CHS,106,0,0,0,,瞧那边!谁住在那里?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.58,0:10:02.82,CHS,107,0,0,0,,那是我的家
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.89,0:10:05.79,CHS,108,0,0,0,,很好!太漂亮了!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.86,0:10:09.66,CHS,109,0,0,0,,你是个相当不错的装饰设计家 在预算有限的情况下  你所做的令人惊叹!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.73,0:10:14.46,CHS,110,0,0,0,,我喜欢那块石头  很漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.24,0:10:20.97,CHS,111,0,0,0,,我猜想你家里不常来客人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.04,0:10:22.84,CHS,112,0,0,0,,我喜欢一个人呆着
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.91,0:10:25.50,CHS,113,0,0,0,,我也是这样  这是我们的另一个共同点
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.58,0:10:27.84,CHS,114,0,0,0,,我讨厌有人来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.91,0:10:31.82,CHS,115,0,0,0,,来了就不肯走  尴尬的沉默
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.95,0:10:37.68,CHS,116,0,0,0,,- 我跟你住可以吗?  - 什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.76,0:10:40.35,CHS,117,0,0,0,,让我跟你一起住  好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.43,0:10:42.72,CHS,118,0,0,0,,- 当然!  - 真的?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.79,0:10:45.19,CHS,119,0,0,0,,- 不!  - 我不想回去!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.26,0:10:49.20,CHS,120,0,0,0,,你知道被当作怪物的感受
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.27,0:10:51.86,CHS,121,0,0,0,,这就是为什么我们要在一起  让我留下吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.94,0:10:55.07,CHS,122,0,0,0,,- 求求你!  - 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.14,0:10:57.73,CHS,123,0,0,0,,- 但你只能呆一晚上  - 谢谢!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.81,0:11:00.18,CHS,124,0,0,0,,- 你干什么... 不! 不! - 这将会很有趣!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.25,0:11:02.15,CHS,125,0,0,0,,我们晚点儿睡  一起讲故事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.25,0:11:05.05,CHS,126,0,0,0,,早上我做薄饼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.12,0:11:08.38,CHS,127,0,0,0,,我在哪里睡?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.45,0:11:10.22,CHS,128,0,0,0,,外面!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.29,0:11:13.38,CHS,129,0,0,0,,哇  那很酷
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.46,0:11:15.55,CHS,130,0,0,0,,我的意思是我不了解你  你也不了解我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.63,0:11:18.03,CHS,131,0,0,0,,因此我想外头最好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.10,0:11:21.09,CHS,132,0,0,0,,我出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.27,0:11:27.36,CHS,133,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.44,0:11:31.43,CHS,134,0,0,0,,我确实喜欢在外面  我是驴  生来就喜欢外面
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.51,0:11:34.21,CHS,135,0,0,0,,只有我一个人在外面
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.28,0:11:36.54,CHS,136,0,0,0,,一个人  在外面
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.65,0:11:41.45,CHS,137,0,0,0,,只有我一个人  这里除了我没有别人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.72,0:12:48.35,CHS,138,0,0,0,,我不是告诉你呆在外头吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.42,0:12:52.12,CHS,139,0,0,0,,我是在外头
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.60,0:13:01.40,CHS,140,0,0,0,,这比农场差远了  不过还有什么办法呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.47,0:13:03.99,CHS,141,0,0,0,,这不是家  但还算不错
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.07,0:13:06.00,CHS,142,0,0,0,,多好的床
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.07,0:13:08.40,CHS,143,0,0,0,,- 抓到你了　 - 我找到了些奶酪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.47,0:13:10.96,CHS,144,0,0,0,,真恶心!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.74,0:13:15.34,CHS,145,0,0,0,,- 是你吗  戈德?  - 你怎么知道是我?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.41,0:13:18.35,CHS,146,0,0,0,,够了!你在我的房子里干嘛?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.42,0:13:23.05,CHS,147,0,0,0,,不  不  不!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.12,0:13:26.72,CHS,148,0,0,0,,- 死人不能放在桌子上  - 可床已经被占了!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.06,0:13:32.69,CHS,149,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.76,0:13:37.50,CHS,150,0,0,0,,我住在沼泽地里  我贴出告示 我是个可怕的怪物!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.60,0:13:40.23,CHS,151,0,0,0,,我怎么才能保留点隐私呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.31,0:13:42.74,CHS,152,0,0,0,,- 啊!  - 不
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.81,0:13:45.54,CHS,153,0,0,0,,哦  不
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.61,0:13:49.21,CHS,154,0,0,0,,不...不!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.62,0:14:01.52,CHS,155,0,0,0,,你们在我的沼泽地里干什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.13,0:14:12.54,CHS,156,0,0,0,,好  出去  你们都离开这里  走开!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.60,0:14:15.04,CHS,157,0,0,0,,快点儿  快!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.11,0:14:17.07,CHS,158,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.14,0:14:19.37,CHS,159,0,0,0,,不是那里  不是那里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.01,0:14:25.92,CHS,160,0,0,0,,别看我  不是我请他们来的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.98,0:14:28.08,CHS,161,0,0,0,,没人请我们来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.15,0:14:30.71,CHS,162,0,0,0,,- 什么?  - 我们被迫来到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.82,0:14:32.95,CHS,163,0,0,0,,- 谁强迫你们?  - 弗瓜王
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.02,0:14:37.79,CHS,164,0,0,0,,他把我们赶走
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.67,0:14:44.93,CHS,165,0,0,0,,谁知道弗瓜王在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.00,0:14:47.80,CHS,166,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.87,0:14:51.57,CHS,167,0,0,0,,还有人知道在哪里能找到他吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.04,0:14:55.31,CHS,168,0,0,0,,- 没人知道?  - 我知道!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.38,0:14:57.31,CHS,169,0,0,0,,- 谁知道?  - 选我!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.38,0:14:59.82,CHS,170,0,0,0,,我知道!我知道!我!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.88,0:15:03.01,CHS,171,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.09,0:15:07.65,CHS,172,0,0,0,,注意  你们这些童话人物
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.73,0:15:12.42,CHS,173,0,0,0,,别再享受了  欢迎已经正式结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.53,0:15:16.26,CHS,174,0,0,0,,实际上  我马上就要去见弗瓜王这个家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.33,0:15:19.43,CHS,175,0,0,0,,把你们从我这里弄走  回你们老家!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.51,0:15:29.98,CHS,176,0,0,0,,你!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.05,0:15:31.98,CHS,177,0,0,0,,你跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.05,0:15:34.38,CHS,178,0,0,0,,这正是我喜欢听到的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.45,0:15:38.29,CHS,179,0,0,0,,史莱克和驴  两个朋友一起去冒险
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.36,0:15:40.35,CHS,180,0,0,0,,我喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.43,0:15:43.62,CHS,181,0,0,0,,又上路了  史莱克  跟我一起唱
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.70,0:15:45.66,CHS,182,0,0,0,,我迫不及待要上路了...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.73,0:15:47.66,CHS,183,0,0,0,,关于唱歌我刚才说什么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.73,0:15:49.67,CHS,184,0,0,0,,- 我可以吹口哨儿吗?   - 不
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.73,0:15:52.53,CHS,185,0,0,0,,- 可以哼歌吗?  - 好吧  哼吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.30,0:16:25.36,CHS,186,0,0,0,,够了  他要开口了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.28,0:16:40.75,CHS,187,0,0,0,,跑  跑  赶快跑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.82,0:16:44.38,CHS,188,0,0,0,,你抓不到我  我是个姜饼人!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.46,0:16:48.05,CHS,189,0,0,0,,- 你是魔鬼  - 我不是  你才是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.13,0:16:52.39,CHS,190,0,0,0,,你和其他的童话垃圾毒害了我完美的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.46,0:16:54.40,CHS,191,0,0,0,,告诉我  他们都到哪里去了?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.47,0:16:57.03,CHS,192,0,0,0,,吃我!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.10,0:17:00.04,CHS,193,0,0,0,,我试着公平地对待你们这些东西
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.10,0:17:03.60,CHS,194,0,0,0,,现在  我的耐心消失了! 告诉我  不然...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.68,0:17:06.47,CHS,195,0,0,0,,不  别动我的糖浆扣子!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.54,0:17:08.57,CHS,196,0,0,0,,谁把他们藏起来了?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.65,0:17:13.98,CHS,197,0,0,0,,好  我告诉你  你知道松饼人吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.05,0:17:16.42,CHS,198,0,0,0,,- 松饼人?   - 松饼人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.49,0:17:19.92,CHS,199,0,0,0,,对  我知道松饼人  她住在特鲁里街?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.99,0:17:23.43,CHS,200,0,0,0,,她跟松饼人结婚了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.49,0:17:25.62,CHS,201,0,0,0,,- 松饼人?  - 松饼人!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.70,0:17:28.72,CHS,202,0,0,0,,她跟松饼人结婚了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.80,0:17:30.46,CHS,203,0,0,0,,主人!我们找到了!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.54,0:17:33.77,CHS,204,0,0,0,,你还等什么?把它带进来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.72,0:17:52.09,CHS,205,0,0,0,,- 魔镜...    - 什么都不要告诉他!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.16,0:17:54.49,CHS,206,0,0,0,,不要!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.56,0:17:58.33,CHS,207,0,0,0,,晚上好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.40,0:18:00.26,CHS,208,0,0,0,,魔镜啊魔镜
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.37,0:18:03.77,CHS,209,0,0,0,,这不是最完美的王国吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.84,0:18:06.43,CHS,210,0,0,0,,严格地讲你不是国王
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.01,0:18:13.64,CHS,211,0,0,0,,- 你说什么?  - 我意思是...你还不是国王
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.71,0:18:17.31,CHS,212,0,0,0,,但你可以成为国王  只要娶个公主就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.38,0:18:20.37,CHS,213,0,0,0,,接着说
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.45,0:18:24.11,CHS,214,0,0,0,,那么  放松点坐下吧  主人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.19,0:18:28.45,CHS,215,0,0,0,,你就要会见当今最合格的未婚女子了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.56,0:18:32.15,CHS,216,0,0,0,,她们来了!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.23,0:18:37.19,CHS,217,0,0,0,,一号来自遥远的王国  精神上倍受折磨
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.27,0:18:39.53,CHS,218,0,0,0,,她喜欢吃寿司和洗热水澡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.60,0:18:43.06,CHS,219,0,0,0,,她还要为她的两个坏姐姐做饭和打扫卫生
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.14,0:18:45.54,CHS,220,0,0,0,,欢迎灰姑娘!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.61,0:18:49.67,CHS,221,0,0,0,,二号是位身穿斗篷的姑娘  她来自奇幻之地
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.75,0:18:52.44,CHS,222,0,0,0,,她与七个男人一起生活  她很不简单
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.55,0:18:56.01,CHS,223,0,0,0,,亲吻她冰凉的嘴唇   看看她火热的激情吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.09,0:18:59.85,CHS,224,0,0,0,,快来为白雪公主鼓掌吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.92,0:19:02.55,CHS,225,0,0,0,,最后一位  但不是最差的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.63,0:19:04.72,CHS,226,0,0,0,,一位红发姑娘来自被龙看守的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.80,0:19:07.36,CHS,227,0,0,0,,火山岩浆围绕的城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.43,0:19:09.49,CHS,228,0,0,0,,但别因此而灰心
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.80,0:19:16.87,CHS,229,0,0,0,,渴望被拯救的菲奥纳公主
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.94,0:19:19.41,CHS,230,0,0,0,,是一号?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.48,0:19:23.00,CHS,231,0,0,0,,二号还是三号?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.08,0:19:25.24,CHS,232,0,0,0,,- 二号!三号!  - 三号!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.32,0:19:26.68,CHS,233,0,0,0,,- 二号!三号!  - 三号!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.75,0:19:28.88,CHS,234,0,0,0,,三号?一号?三号?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.95,0:19:30.98,CHS,235,0,0,0,,选三号  主人!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.09,0:19:34.86,CHS,236,0,0,0,,好  好  三号!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.93,0:19:39.69,CHS,237,0,0,0,,弗瓜王  你选了菲奥纳公主
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.63,0:19:46.97,CHS,238,0,0,0,,菲奥纳公主
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.04,0:19:49.23,CHS,239,0,0,0,,她是完美的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.31,0:19:52.07,CHS,240,0,0,0,,我只想找一个能去...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.14,0:19:54.41,CHS,241,0,0,0,,我应该说一下发生在晚上的事...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.48,0:19:56.41,CHS,242,0,0,0,,- 我会跟她结婚的  - 可是日落后...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.48,0:20:00.58,CHS,243,0,0,0,,安静!我要菲奥纳公主做我的王后
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.65,0:20:04.82,CHS,244,0,0,0,,杜洛克将会有一个十全十美的国王
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.89,0:20:07.12,CHS,245,0,0,0,,队长  召集你最优秀的部下
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.19,0:20:11.06,CHS,246,0,0,0,,我们要举行一场比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.73,0:20:15.76,CHS,247,0,0,0,,就是那里  那就是杜洛克
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.83,0:20:17.89,CHS,248,0,0,0,,我说过我会找到的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.97,0:20:22.07,CHS,249,0,0,0,,那么  那一定是弗瓜王的城堡了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.17,0:20:24.27,CHS,250,0,0,0,,就是那里
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.34,0:20:27.78,CHS,251,0,0,0,,你看他是不是在弥补什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.02,0:20:33.98,CHS,252,0,0,0,,等等!等一下  史莱克
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.05,0:20:36.92,CHS,253,0,0,0,,快点儿  宝贝儿  我们晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.16,0:20:44.99,CHS,254,0,0,0,,等等  我不会吃掉你的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.06,0:20:49.00,CHS,255,0,0,0,,我只是...我只是...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.53,0:21:21.09,CHS,256,0,0,0,,很安静
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.53,0:21:25.83,CHS,257,0,0,0,,太安静了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.41,0:21:32.54,CHS,258,0,0,0,,- 人都到哪去了?  - 你看看这个!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.92,0:21:49.36,CHS,259,0,0,0,,欢迎来杜洛克这个美丽的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.43,0:21:52.83,CHS,260,0,0,0,,有一些规则要和你分享
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.93,0:21:56.83,CHS,261,0,0,0,,要安静守秩序才会有好环境
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.90,0:22:00.53,CHS,262,0,0,0,,杜洛克是个好地方
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.61,0:22:05.17,CHS,263,0,0,0,,要爱护花和树  擦亮鞋  擦净...脸
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.24,0:22:08.84,CHS,264,0,0,0,,杜洛克是  杜洛克是
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.91,0:22:12.37,CHS,265,0,0,0,,杜洛克是个好...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.45,0:22:15.89,CHS,266,0,0,0,,地方
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.12,0:22:23.86,CHS,267,0,0,0,,我们再来一遍!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.93,0:22:26.59,CHS,268,0,0,0,,不  不  不  不!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.23,0:22:31.36,CHS,269,0,0,0,,勇敢的骑士们
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.47,0:22:35.60,CHS,270,0,0,0,,你们是世界上最优秀  最聪明的人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.67,0:22:38.11,CHS,271,0,0,0,,今天  你们中的一个将证明...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.18,0:22:40.54,CHS,272,0,0,0,,你想挨巴掌吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.61,0:22:42.55,CHS,273,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.61,0:22:48.11,CHS,274,0,0,0,,冠军将得到荣誉...不...特权
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.19,0:22:52.21,CHS,275,0,0,0,,去救出可爱的菲奥纳公主
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.32,0:22:55.66,CHS,276,0,0,0,,从火龙严密的看守中
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.73,0:22:59.96,CHS,277,0,0,0,,如果因为意外冠军没有成功
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.03,0:23:03.23,CHS,278,0,0,0,,亚军将代替他...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.30,0:23:06.10,CHS,279,0,0,0,,以此类推
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.17,0:23:11.61,CHS,280,0,0,0,,你们有些人可能会牺牲  但这是自愿的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.71,0:23:19.15,CHS,281,0,0,0,,比赛现在开始!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.86,0:23:28.12,CHS,282,0,0,0,,那是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.19,0:23:32.79,CHS,283,0,0,0,,- 丑的吓人!  - 这不是很漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.86,0:23:35.30,CHS,284,0,0,0,,不过是头驴而已
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.37,0:23:38.34,CHS,285,0,0,0,,骑士们  新计划!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.40,0:23:43.14,CHS,286,0,0,0,,杀死那个怪物的人将被授予冠军!进攻!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.21,0:23:47.14,CHS,287,0,0,0,,- 抓住他!  - 嘿  现在  赶快!等等...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.21,0:23:49.51,CHS,288,0,0,0,,去!抓住他!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.58,0:23:53.28,CHS,289,0,0,0,,我们可以友好的解决吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.35,0:23:54.61,CHS,290,0,0,0,,杀了这个怪物!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.69,0:23:59.15,CHS,291,0,0,0,,不?那么  好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.22,0:24:01.28,CHS,292,0,0,0,,来吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.10,0:24:13.54,CHS,293,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.60,0:24:17.63,CHS,294,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.71,0:24:20.51,CHS,295,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.58,0:24:22.84,CHS,296,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.91,0:24:26.85,CHS,297,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.92,0:24:30.68,CHS,298,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.76,0:24:34.16,CHS,299,0,0,0,,嘿  史莱克  让我来!让我来!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.23,0:24:36.99,CHS,300,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.06,0:24:39.33,CHS,301,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.97,0:24:44.03,CHS,302,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.10,0:24:46.19,CHS,303,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.27,0:24:48.20,CHS,304,0,0,0,,给他椅子!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.27,0:24:50.90,CHS,305,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.98,0:24:54.17,CHS,306,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.25,0:24:55.68,CHS,307,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.75,0:24:58.41,CHS,308,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.48,0:25:02.18,CHS,309,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.25,0:25:04.69,CHS,310,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.13,0:25:15.93,CHS,311,0,0,0,,谢谢!非常感谢!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.00,0:25:18.40,CHS,312,0,0,0,,我在这里呆到周四  尝尝牛排!哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.84,0:25:26.81,CHS,313,0,0,0,,我可以下令吗  主人?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.88,0:25:30.47,CHS,314,0,0,0,,不  我有个更好的主意
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.55,0:25:35.75,CHS,315,0,0,0,,杜洛克的人们  他就是我们的冠军!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.82,0:25:39.72,CHS,316,0,0,0,,- 什么?　- 祝贺你  怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.79,0:25:44.12,CHS,317,0,0,0,,你赢得了一个伟大  高尚任务的荣誉
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.20,0:25:48.60,CHS,318,0,0,0,,任务?我的任务就是要归还我的沼泽地
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.67,0:25:51.90,CHS,319,0,0,0,,- 你的沼泽地?  - 对  我的沼泽地!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.97,0:25:54.44,CHS,320,0,0,0,,你把那些童话人物丢弃到那里!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.17,0:25:59.27,CHS,321,0,0,0,,好吧  怪物  我们做个交易
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.34,0:26:03.14,CHS,322,0,0,0,,你为我完成任务  我就把沼泽地还给你
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.21,0:26:05.94,CHS,323,0,0,0,,恢复原状?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.02,0:26:08.78,CHS,324,0,0,0,,跟原来一模一样
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.85,0:26:12.08,CHS,325,0,0,0,,- 那些不速之客呢?  - 全都弄走
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.16,0:26:19.12,CHS,326,0,0,0,,什么样的任务?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.43,0:26:21.80,CHS,327,0,0,0,,你要去跟龙作战
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.87,0:26:24.49,CHS,328,0,0,0,,救出公主  然后弗瓜王把沼泽地还给你
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.57,0:26:27.70,CHS,329,0,0,0,,你的沼泽地现在被弗瓜王塞满了怪物  对吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.77,0:26:32.14,CHS,330,0,0,0,,也许驴不能讲话是有道理的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.21,0:26:35.77,CHS,331,0,0,0,,你为什么不把你的魔力都用在他身上?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.85,0:26:37.78,CHS,332,0,0,0,,包围他的堡垒
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.85,0:26:40.68,CHS,333,0,0,0,,碾碎他们的骨头夹面包吃  怪物所有的本事
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.75,0:26:42.69,CHS,334,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.75,0:26:44.98,CHS,335,0,0,0,,也许我可以砍掉全村人的头
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.06,0:26:47.18,CHS,336,0,0,0,,把他们的头挂在长矛上
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.26,0:26:50.89,CHS,337,0,0,0,,拿刀割开他们的肚子  喝他们的血
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.96,0:26:53.09,CHS,338,0,0,0,,你看怎么样?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.20,0:26:55.83,CHS,339,0,0,0,,不  真的  不怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.90,0:26:59.70,CHS,340,0,0,0,,告诉你  怪物比你想像的复杂
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.77,0:27:02.53,CHS,341,0,0,0,,- 举个例子　 - 例子?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.61,0:27:08.74,CHS,342,0,0,0,,- 好...怪物就像洋葱  - 有臭味?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.81,0:27:11.14,CHS,343,0,0,0,,- 不  - 让你流泪?  - 不!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.22,0:27:14.65,CHS,344,0,0,0,,把它们放在阳光下晒成棕色  会长出嫩芽?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.72,0:27:16.71,CHS,345,0,0,0,,是层!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.79,0:27:19.15,CHS,346,0,0,0,,洋葱有很多层
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.22,0:27:22.52,CHS,347,0,0,0,,怪物有层  洋葱也有层
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.59,0:27:24.99,CHS,348,0,0,0,,你明白吗?我们都有好多层
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.93,0:27:30.53,CHS,349,0,0,0,,你们都有好多层
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.60,0:27:34.00,CHS,350,0,0,0,,可并不是人人都喜欢洋葱
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.07,0:27:36.70,CHS,351,0,0,0,,蛋糕!大家都喜欢蛋糕!蛋糕也有层
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.77,0:27:40.71,CHS,352,0,0,0,,我不在乎...大家喜欢什么
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.78,0:27:44.48,CHS,353,0,0,0,,怪物不像蛋糕
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.32,0:27:49.72,CHS,354,0,0,0,,你知道大家还喜欢什么?冰淇淋
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.79,0:27:51.72,CHS,355,0,0,0,,你试过问别人:吃冰淇淋吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.79,0:27:53.42,CHS,356,0,0,0,,他回答 “不  我不喜欢冰淇淋”
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.46,0:27:55.43,CHS,357,0,0,0,,- 冰淇淋很好吃  - 没有!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.46,0:27:58.43,CHS,358,0,0,0,,你这个愚蠢讨厌的驴
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.46,0:28:01.43,CHS,359,0,0,0,,怪物像洋葱!行了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.47,0:28:03.59,CHS,360,0,0,0,,再见  回头见
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.27,0:28:12.71,CHS,361,0,0,0,,冰淇淋也许是这个世界上最美味的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.78,0:28:14.97,CHS,362,0,0,0,,我想我宁愿听你哼歌
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.05,0:28:17.74,CHS,363,0,0,0,,你有纸巾吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.82,0:28:20.72,CHS,364,0,0,0,,提起冰淇淋让我流口水了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.16,0:28:31.06,CHS,365,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.70,0:28:39.16,CHS,366,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.81,0:28:45.71,CHS,367,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.81,0:28:49.75,CHS,368,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.81,0:28:52.75,CHS,369,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.85,0:28:56.75,CHS,370,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.86,0:28:59.95,CHS,371,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.02,0:29:02.49,CHS,372,0,0,0,,史莱克!是你干的吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.56,0:29:06.36,CHS,373,0,0,0,,你放屁之前得通知一声
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.43,0:29:10.16,CHS,374,0,0,0,,相信我  小驴  如果是我  你早就薰死了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.23,0:29:13.00,CHS,375,0,0,0,,是硫磺
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.07,0:29:16.27,CHS,376,0,0,0,,- 我们一定快到了  - 对  硫磺...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.34,0:29:20.44,CHS,377,0,0,0,,别告诉我硫磺  我知道我闻到了什么  不可能是硫磺
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.51,0:29:22.45,CHS,378,0,0,0,,也没有什么石头
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.46,0:29:43.83,CHS,379,0,0,0,,确实  这地方够大的  看看这周围
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.94,0:29:51.67,CHS,380,0,0,0,,史莱克?记得你说过怪物有好多层吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.74,0:29:53.68,CHS,381,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.74,0:29:57.34,CHS,382,0,0,0,,我有点儿事要坦白
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.41,0:30:00.78,CHS,383,0,0,0,,驴没有好多层  我们的恐惧都表现在袖子上
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.88,0:30:04.95,CHS,384,0,0,0,,- 等等!驴没有袖子  - 你明白我的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.06,0:30:07.72,CHS,385,0,0,0,,你不要对我说你有恐高症
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.79,0:30:12.39,CHS,386,0,0,0,,走在沸腾岩浆上面的桥上  我有点不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.46,0:30:16.52,CHS,387,0,0,0,,别怕  小驴  我就在你旁边
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.60,0:30:19.26,CHS,388,0,0,0,,鼓励你
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.34,0:30:23.90,CHS,389,0,0,0,,我们一起走  一次只迈一小步
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.97,0:30:25.91,CHS,390,0,0,0,,- 真的?  - 真的  真的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.98,0:30:29.21,CHS,391,0,0,0,,- 这样我感觉好多了  - 继续走
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.28,0:30:33.88,CHS,392,0,0,0,,- 别往下看...   - 继续走  别往下看
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.95,0:30:37.32,CHS,393,0,0,0,,别往下看  向前走  别往下看
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.42,0:30:41.22,CHS,394,0,0,0,,史莱克!我在往下看!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.29,0:30:44.23,CHS,395,0,0,0,,我过不去了!请放了我吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.29,0:30:47.86,CHS,396,0,0,0,,- 你已经走了一半了!  - 我知道那部分安全!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.93,0:30:50.73,CHS,397,0,0,0,,好  我没有时间  你回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.80,0:30:53.24,CHS,398,0,0,0,,史莱克!等等!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.30,0:30:56.40,CHS,399,0,0,0,,- 我们跳个舞吧  - 别这样!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.47,0:31:00.38,CHS,400,0,0,0,,对不起  不要怎样?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.44,0:31:03.54,CHS,401,0,0,0,,- 这样?  - 对  那样
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.61,0:31:07.05,CHS,402,0,0,0,,对?就这样  好
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.12,0:31:09.42,CHS,403,0,0,0,,不  史莱克
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.49,0:31:12.61,CHS,404,0,0,0,,- 不!停下!  - 你说就这样!我在这样做啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.69,0:31:16.96,CHS,405,0,0,0,,史莱克  我要死了  我要死了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.63,0:31:23.62,CHS,406,0,0,0,,这就行了  小驴  这就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.00,0:31:27.97,CHS,407,0,0,0,,酷
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.34,0:31:32.10,CHS,408,0,0,0,,那个喷火的家伙在哪?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.18,0:31:35.94,CHS,409,0,0,0,,在里面  等我们来救她
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.01,0:31:38.91,CHS,410,0,0,0,,我说的是那条龙  史莱克
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.40,0:31:56.33,CHS,411,0,0,0,,你怕吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.40,0:31:59.70,CHS,412,0,0,0,,不怕  嘘...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.77,0:32:03.33,CHS,413,0,0,0,,嗯  我也不怕
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.41,0:32:06.81,CHS,414,0,0,0,,害怕并不是过错
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.88,0:32:10.11,CHS,415,0,0,0,,害怕是对陌生环境的敏感反应
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.21,0:32:12.27,CHS,416,0,0,0,,陌生的危险环境  我应该说
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.35,0:32:14.98,CHS,417,0,0,0,,有一条吃人的会喷火的龙
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.05,0:32:18.51,CHS,418,0,0,0,,害怕并不意味着你是胆小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.59,0:32:22.58,CHS,419,0,0,0,,我知道史莱克不是胆小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.69,0:32:26.03,CHS,420,0,0,0,,驴  答应我两件事  好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.10,0:32:28.66,CHS,421,0,0,0,,闭...嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.73,0:32:31.50,CHS,422,0,0,0,,去那边看看能不能找到楼梯
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.57,0:32:34.20,CHS,423,0,0,0,,楼梯?我想我们在找公主
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.27,0:32:39.17,CHS,424,0,0,0,,公主在最高的塔内最高的房间里
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.24,0:32:42.84,CHS,425,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道她在那里? - 我从书上看到的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.91,0:32:46.85,CHS,426,0,0,0,,酷  你对付龙  我来找楼梯
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.92,0:32:49.98,CHS,427,0,0,0,,等我找到楼梯  我也要抽它们的屁股
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.05,0:32:52.02,CHS,428,0,0,0,,楼梯不知道通向哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.49,0:32:58.48,CHS,429,0,0,0,,我要走难走的路
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.56,0:33:01.36,CHS,430,0,0,0,,别打扰我  我是爬楼梯老手
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.43,0:33:05.99,CHS,431,0,0,0,,我已经占领楼梯了  踏上一步就没有问题了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.97,0:33:12.53,CHS,432,0,0,0,,至少我们知道公主在哪里  但...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.61,0:33:16.84,CHS,433,0,0,0,,龙!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.46,0:33:32.69,CHS,434,0,0,0,,小驴  当心!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.34,0:33:46.37,CHS,435,0,0,0,,抓住你了!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.65,0:34:29.28,CHS,436,0,0,0,,你的牙齿真大
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.35,0:34:33.19,CHS,437,0,0,0,,我是说  闪亮的牙齿 我知道你经常听到食物这么对你说
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.26,0:34:37.42,CHS,438,0,0,0,,但你一定漂白了  因为笑起来很耀眼
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.49,0:34:39.99,CHS,439,0,0,0,,我闻到了  有薄荷的清香
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.06,0:34:44.83,CHS,440,0,0,0,,你知道吗?  你是条龙姑娘!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.90,0:34:49.43,CHS,441,0,0,0,,当然!我是说  当然你是龙姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.51,0:34:53.31,CHS,442,0,0,0,,你身上散发着女性的美
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.38,0:34:55.71,CHS,443,0,0,0,,你怎么了?眼里掉进东西了?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.72,0:35:01.12,CHS,444,0,0,0,,我真的愿意留下  但...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.22,0:35:05.18,CHS,445,0,0,0,,我有哮喘病  如果你吐烟圈我会受不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.26,0:35:07.19,CHS,446,0,0,0,,史莱克!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.26,0:35:10.99,CHS,447,0,0,0,,不  史莱克!史莱克!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.76,0:35:47.70,CHS,448,0,0,0,,- 醒醒!  - 什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.76,0:35:49.39,CHS,449,0,0,0,,你是菲奥纳公主吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.47,0:35:54.84,CHS,450,0,0,0,,我是  我在等待一个勇敢的骑士来救我
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.91,0:35:56.90,CHS,451,0,0,0,,很好  我们走吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.97,0:35:59.00,CHS,452,0,0,0,,等等  骑士先生
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.08,0:36:01.37,CHS,453,0,0,0,,这是我们第一次见面
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.45,0:36:05.18,CHS,454,0,0,0,,这不是一个非常浪漫的时刻吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.25,0:36:09.58,CHS,455,0,0,0,,- 是  对不起  小姐  没时间了 - 等等  你在干什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.65,0:36:11.75,CHS,456,0,0,0,,你应该抱起我...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.82,0:36:15.22,CHS,457,0,0,0,,跳出窗外落在你的战马上
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.29,0:36:18.09,CHS,458,0,0,0,,你计划这些很长时间了  是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.50,0:36:25.40,CHS,459,0,0,0,,但我们应该享受这个时刻!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.47,0:36:28.23,CHS,460,0,0,0,,你该给我朗诵一段美丽的史诗
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.31,0:36:30.77,CHS,461,0,0,0,,小诗?歌谣!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.84,0:36:34.11,CHS,462,0,0,0,,- 五行诗?或是别的! - 我不这样想
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.18,0:36:38.61,CHS,463,0,0,0,,至少我该知道勇士的名字吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.68,0:36:40.62,CHS,464,0,0,0,,我叫史莱克
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.68,0:36:44.42,CHS,465,0,0,0,,史莱克先生
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.49,0:36:49.22,CHS,466,0,0,0,,我祈求你把这个手帕当作我感激的象征
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.36,0:36:52.35,CHS,467,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.37,0:36:58.23,CHS,468,0,0,0,,你没把龙杀死?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.30,0:37:00.27,CHS,469,0,0,0,,这在我的计划内  快走!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.84,0:37:02.73,CHS,470,0,0,0,,不该这样的!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.51,0:37:05.77,CHS,471,0,0,0,,你应该像其他骑士一样  勇往直前
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.84,0:37:07.94,CHS,472,0,0,0,,所有的骑士都应该这样
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.51,0:37:09.77,CHS,473,0,0,0,,是的  在他们被烧成灰烬之前
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.38,0:37:12.24,CHS,474,0,0,0,,这不是问题所在
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.02,0:37:16.49,CHS,475,0,0,0,,你去哪里?出口在那边
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.55,0:37:18.61,CHS,476,0,0,0,,我要救我的驴
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.69,0:37:21.89,CHS,477,0,0,0,,你是什么样的骑士?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.99,0:37:24.43,CHS,478,0,0,0,,独一无二的骑士
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.49,0:37:26.86,CHS,479,0,0,0,,慢点儿  慢点儿  宝贝儿
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.93,0:37:29.16,CHS,480,0,0,0,,时间久了才能全面了解一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.23,0:37:33.83,CHS,481,0,0,0,,就叫我老古板吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.90,0:37:37.43,CHS,482,0,0,0,,我不想仓促的进一步发展关系
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.51,0:37:40.97,CHS,483,0,0,0,,我感情上还没准备好这...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.04,0:37:43.34,CHS,484,0,0,0,,我在寻找...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.41,0:37:46.91,CHS,485,0,0,0,,这不需要身体接触
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.02,0:37:49.49,CHS,486,0,0,0,,你在干什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.55,0:37:52.82,CHS,487,0,0,0,,让我们回头一步一步发展
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.89,0:37:57.02,CHS,488,0,0,0,,我们应该先做个朋友或者笔友
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.09,0:38:01.33,CHS,489,0,0,0,,我经常旅行  我喜欢收到明信片...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.40,0:38:03.83,CHS,490,0,0,0,,我真的想留下  但...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.90,0:38:06.49,CHS,491,0,0,0,,别动!这是我私人的尾巴
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.57,0:38:10.01,CHS,492,0,0,0,,你要把它去掉?我还没同意
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.07,0:38:13.87,CHS,493,0,0,0,,现在!不行  不!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.01,0:38:16.06,CHS,494,0,0,0,,不!不!不!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.57,0:38:45.54,CHS,495,0,0,0,,- 嗨  公主!  - 它会说话!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.61,0:38:49.38,CHS,496,0,0,0,,对  让他闭嘴得有诀窍
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.95,0:39:26.85,CHS,497,0,0,0,,好  你们俩先走!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.98,0:39:30.51,CHS,498,0,0,0,,我来对付这条龙
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.13,0:39:42.53,CHS,499,0,0,0,,快跑
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.11,0:40:29.91,CHS,500,0,0,0,,你成功了!你救了我!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.98,0:40:31.78,CHS,501,0,0,0,,真令人惊叹  你...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.85,0:40:33.61,CHS,502,0,0,0,,你太伟大了  你是...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.69,0:40:37.98,CHS,503,0,0,0,,我承认你有点儿怪
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.05,0:40:42.99,CHS,504,0,0,0,,但你的行为伟大  心地纯洁
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.06,0:40:46.86,CHS,505,0,0,0,,我会永远感激你
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.93,0:40:51.30,CHS,506,0,0,0,,没有高贵的马  哪有勇敢的骑士?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.37,0:40:56.03,CHS,507,0,0,0,,我希望你听到了  她说我是高贵的马!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.11,0:40:59.00,CHS,508,0,0,0,,我们胜利了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.38,0:41:01.87,CHS,509,0,0,0,,你可以摘掉头盔了  骑士先生
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.95,0:41:04.54,CHS,510,0,0,0,,- 不?  - 为什么不?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.61,0:41:06.84,CHS,511,0,0,0,,我...我的头发很乱
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.92,0:41:10.15,CHS,512,0,0,0,,求求你  我想看看我的救命恩人
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.22,0:41:12.81,CHS,513,0,0,0,,不  不  你不想...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.89,0:41:15.36,CHS,514,0,0,0,,你会吻我吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.43,0:41:19.19,CHS,515,0,0,0,,什么?这不在工作范围内
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.26,0:41:21.66,CHS,516,0,0,0,,也许这是个奖赏
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.73,0:41:26.17,CHS,517,0,0,0,,不  是命运  你一定知道是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.24,0:41:30.00,CHS,518,0,0,0,,一个被关在塔里  由龙看守的公主
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.11,0:41:33.04,CHS,519,0,0,0,,被一个勇敢的骑士搭救了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.11,0:41:36.41,CHS,520,0,0,0,,然后他们分享了真爱的初吻
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.48,0:41:39.17,CHS,521,0,0,0,,和史莱克?  你想...等等
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.25,0:41:41.85,CHS,522,0,0,0,,你以为他是你的真爱?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.92,0:41:43.91,CHS,523,0,0,0,,是啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.96,0:41:50.43,CHS,524,0,0,0,,你以为史莱克是你的真爱?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.49,0:41:52.43,CHS,525,0,0,0,,这有什么好笑的?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.21,0:41:56.30,CHS,526,0,0,0,,我不是你喜欢的类型
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.38,0:41:59.90,CHS,527,0,0,0,,你是的  你救了我
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.98,0:42:02.45,CHS,528,0,0,0,,现在  摘掉你的头盔
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.52,0:42:04.75,CHS,529,0,0,0,,我想这样不太好
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.82,0:42:06.81,CHS,530,0,0,0,,- 把头盔摘掉吧   - 不
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.89,0:42:08.08,CHS,531,0,0,0,,- 摘掉!  - 不!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.15,0:42:10.25,CHS,532,0,0,0,,- 立刻!  - 好!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.32,0:42:14.82,CHS,533,0,0,0,,听你的命令  公主殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.87,0:42:28.31,CHS,534,0,0,0,,你...你是个怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.37,0:42:32.28,CHS,535,0,0,0,,你以为我是个白马王子?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.38,0:42:34.87,CHS,536,0,0,0,,嗯  对  是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.78,0:42:40.05,CHS,537,0,0,0,,不  都搞错了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.12,0:42:42.45,CHS,538,0,0,0,,你不应该是个怪物的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.52,0:42:47.79,CHS,539,0,0,0,,公主  我是被弗瓜王派来救你的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.86,0:42:49.79,CHS,540,0,0,0,,是他想跟你结婚
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.86,0:42:51.80,CHS,541,0,0,0,,那他为什么不亲自来救我?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.86,0:42:56.20,CHS,542,0,0,0,,问的好  你应该去那里问他
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.27,0:42:59.33,CHS,543,0,0,0,,我必须被我的真爱搭救
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.41,0:43:02.17,CHS,544,0,0,0,,而不该是被怪物和他的宠物搭救
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.24,0:43:04.30,CHS,545,0,0,0,,再也不是高贵的马了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.38,0:43:07.00,CHS,546,0,0,0,,你使我的任务更麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.08,0:43:10.48,CHS,547,0,0,0,,对不起  你的任务与我无关
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.55,0:43:15.82,CHS,548,0,0,0,,你去告诉弗瓜王  如果他真的想救我...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.89,0:43:18.22,CHS,549,0,0,0,,我就在这里等他
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.29,0:43:23.32,CHS,550,0,0,0,,嘿  我不负责传信  我只管送你
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.43,0:43:25.69,CHS,551,0,0,0,,你不敢
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.76,0:43:27.76,CHS,552,0,0,0,,- 把我放下!  - 你来吗  小驴?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.83,0:43:29.82,CHS,553,0,0,0,,我在后面跟着你
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.90,0:43:33.50,CHS,554,0,0,0,,放下我  不然你后果自负!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.57,0:43:36.57,CHS,555,0,0,0,,你太不尊敬我了!放下我!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.54,0:43:41.04,CHS,556,0,0,0,,我又有个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.11,0:43:44.17,CHS,557,0,0,0,,有个女人喜欢你  但你不喜欢她
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.25,0:43:46.62,CHS,558,0,0,0,,怎么才能摆脱她而不让她感情受伤害呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.69,0:43:49.21,CHS,559,0,0,0,,而你也不会被她所伤害?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.29,0:43:52.05,CHS,560,0,0,0,,应该告诉她  她不是你的真爱
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.12,0:43:54.85,CHS,561,0,0,0,,当发现你的真爱时  每个人都知道...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.60,0:43:59.86,CHS,562,0,0,0,,真想一下子赶到杜洛克
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.97,0:44:02.90,CHS,563,0,0,0,,你会喜欢那里的  公主  那里很美丽!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.97,0:44:06.73,CHS,564,0,0,0,,我的未婚夫弗瓜王怎么样? 他长什么样?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.81,0:44:08.93,CHS,565,0,0,0,,这么说吧  公主
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.01,0:44:14.14,CHS,566,0,0,0,,像弗瓜王那样身材的人世间少有
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.11,0:44:19.21,CHS,567,0,0,0,,不  史莱克  想起他的人都很少
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.32,0:44:24.22,CHS,568,0,0,0,,停下  你俩都停下
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.29,0:44:29.25,CHS,569,0,0,0,,你们只是在嫉妒   你们没法跟伟大的弗瓜王相比
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.33,0:44:32.26,CHS,570,0,0,0,,是  也许你说得对  公主
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.33,0:44:35.63,CHS,571,0,0,0,,明天你见到他时  最好亲自量量他
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.70,0:44:39.93,CHS,572,0,0,0,,明天?要等那么久?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.01,0:44:44.70,CHS,573,0,0,0,,- 我们停下露营吧? - 不  那样浪费时间
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.81,0:44:49.25,CHS,574,0,0,0,,- 我们接着走吧 - 但是森林里可能有强盗
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.32,0:44:52.65,CHS,575,0,0,0,,停下!露营这个主意不错!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.72,0:44:56.81,CHS,576,0,0,0,,嘿  我比这个森林里任何东西都可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.89,0:44:59.26,CHS,577,0,0,0,,我现在要找个地方露营!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.17,0:45:10.26,CHS,578,0,0,0,,- 嘿!过来! - 史莱克  我们可以找个更好的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.34,0:45:12.93,CHS,579,0,0,0,,我认为对公主来说并不适合
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.01,0:45:15.90,CHS,580,0,0,0,,不  这很不错   只不过需要一点家的气氛
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.97,0:45:20.81,CHS,581,0,0,0,,家的气氛?像什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.88,0:45:25.15,CHS,582,0,0,0,,一扇门?好吧  绅士们  晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.22,0:45:27.62,CHS,583,0,0,0,,我临睡前给你讲个故事好吗?我会讲...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.69,0:45:30.02,CHS,584,0,0,0,,我说了  晚安!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.46,0:45:34.45,CHS,585,0,0,0,,史莱克  你要做什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.53,0:45:37.55,CHS,586,0,0,0,,我只是...你知道...没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.63,0:45:40.26,CHS,587,0,0,0,,我只是开玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.57,0:45:49.17,CHS,588,0,0,0,,呃  那个  那是斯洛白克
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.24,0:45:52.68,CHS,589,0,0,0,,是唯一一个能吐过三块麦田的怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.75,0:45:55.84,CHS,590,0,0,0,,对  恩
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.91,0:45:58.85,CHS,591,0,0,0,,哎  你能通过星象预言我的未来吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.92,0:46:02.51,CHS,592,0,0,0,,星象不能告诉我们未来   小驴  它会讲故事
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.59,0:46:06.18,CHS,593,0,0,0,,看  那是布拉纳特臭气
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.26,0:46:09.89,CHS,594,0,0,0,,- 你可以猜出为什么它很出名 - 我知道你在瞎编
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.96,0:46:12.69,CHS,595,0,0,0,,不  看  它在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.77,0:46:15.86,CHS,596,0,0,0,,猎人们都被它熏跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.93,0:46:18.49,CHS,597,0,0,0,,它们只是一群小星星
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.60,0:46:22.54,CHS,598,0,0,0,,有时候事情不像表面看起来那么简单
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.84,0:46:26.90,CHS,599,0,0,0,,算了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.75,0:46:33.51,CHS,600,0,0,0,,嘿  史莱克  我们回到沼泽地之后做什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.59,0:46:35.38,CHS,601,0,0,0,,我们的沼泽?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.45,0:46:37.55,CHS,602,0,0,0,,你知道  我们救了公主
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.62,0:46:42.39,CHS,603,0,0,0,,我们?小驴  不是"我们"  没有"我们"
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.46,0:46:44.73,CHS,604,0,0,0,,那是"我"和"我的沼泽地"
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.80,0:46:49.06,CHS,605,0,0,0,,我要做的第一件事就是 在我的领地上建一个十英尺高的围墙
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.13,0:46:51.63,CHS,606,0,0,0,,你伤害了我  史莱克
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.70,0:46:55.04,CHS,607,0,0,0,,你刚才深深的伤害了我
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.14,0:46:57.07,CHS,608,0,0,0,,你知道我在想什么吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.14,0:47:00.27,CHS,609,0,0,0,,我想围墙只是为了阻挡某些人
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.35,0:47:04.54,CHS,610,0,0,0,,- 不  你这么想?  - 你想藏点东西?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.62,0:47:06.58,CHS,611,0,0,0,,别介意  小驴
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.65,0:47:10.09,CHS,612,0,0,0,,哦  这是另一个洋葱的问题  不是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.16,0:47:13.75,CHS,613,0,0,0,,不  这是一个不该谈论的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.83,0:47:17.59,CHS,614,0,0,0,,- 为什么你不想谈这个?  - 为什么你想?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.66,0:47:19.46,CHS,615,0,0,0,,- 为什么你要封闭自己?  - 我没有
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.53,0:47:21.80,CHS,616,0,0,0,,- 哦  你是的   - 小驴  我警告你
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.87,0:47:25.36,CHS,617,0,0,0,,- 你想阻挡谁?  - 所有人!行了吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.64,0:47:29.11,CHS,618,0,0,0,,哦  我们现在有所进展了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.17,0:47:32.47,CHS,619,0,0,0,,哦  你饶了我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.54,0:47:34.98,CHS,620,0,0,0,,你有什么问题? 你对整个世界有什么不满吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.05,0:47:37.28,CHS,621,0,0,0,,不是我有什么不满  好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.35,0:47:40.32,CHS,622,0,0,0,,是世界对我不满
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.39,0:47:44.29,CHS,623,0,0,0,,人们看见我就逃:啊  救命  快跑!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.36,0:47:48.12,CHS,624,0,0,0,,一个又丑又蠢的怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.19,0:47:52.39,CHS,625,0,0,0,,他们不了解我就下了结论
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.50,0:47:54.40,CHS,626,0,0,0,,所以我最好单独生活
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.34,0:48:04.54,CHS,627,0,0,0,,你知道吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.61,0:48:10.31,CHS,628,0,0,0,,我遇到你时   我不认为你是一个"又蠢又丑的怪物"
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.38,0:48:13.32,CHS,629,0,0,0,,是的  我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.39,0:48:16.82,CHS,630,0,0,0,,呃  天上有驴吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.89,0:48:20.19,CHS,631,0,0,0,,恩  有  是头多嘴的...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.36,0:48:22.62,CHS,632,0,0,0,,烦人的小驴
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.73,0:48:27.67,CHS,633,0,0,0,,哦  我看到了  那个又大又亮的   是那边那个吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.73,0:48:30.90,CHS,634,0,0,0,,- 那是月亮   - 哦
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.26,0:48:54.69,CHS,635,0,0,0,,再让我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.13,0:49:03.23,CHS,636,0,0,0,,镜子  镜子  再让我看看公主
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.44,0:49:12.24,CHS,637,0,0,0,,啊  太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.47,0:50:18.38,CHS,638,0,0,0,,嗯  你知道  我喜欢这样
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.44,0:50:22.78,CHS,639,0,0,0,,- 对  宝贝  我说过我喜欢这样 - 小驴  醒醒
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.85,0:50:25.41,CHS,640,0,0,0,,- 呃  什么?  - 起床了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.48,0:50:27.45,CHS,641,0,0,0,,- 什么?   - 早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.52,0:50:30.78,CHS,642,0,0,0,,你喜欢吃什么样的蛋?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.86,0:50:34.82,CHS,643,0,0,0,,- 早上好  公主!  - 这是怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.89,0:50:38.85,CHS,644,0,0,0,,我们昨天相处的不怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.93,0:50:40.96,CHS,645,0,0,0,,今天我想补偿一下
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.03,0:50:45.60,CHS,646,0,0,0,,毕竟  是你救了我
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.67,0:50:48.66,CHS,647,0,0,0,,呃  谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.74,0:50:52.54,CHS,648,0,0,0,,好吧  快吃  还有很重要的事情呢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.02,0:50:58.98,CHS,649,0,0,0,,史莱克!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.05,0:51:00.95,CHS,650,0,0,0,,什么?这是赞美
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.02,0:51:03.99,CHS,651,0,0,0,,我总认为  出去比进去好
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.06,0:51:07.82,CHS,652,0,0,0,,在公主面前不要这样
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.89,0:51:10.52,CHS,653,0,0,0,,- 谢谢  - 她和你一样粗鲁
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.60,0:51:15.46,CHS,654,0,0,0,,你知道  你并不清楚我想要什么
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.53,0:51:20.63,CHS,655,0,0,0,,在了解一个人之前最好不要轻易下结论
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.78,0:51:27.71,CHS,656,0,0,0,,公主!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.78,0:51:30.48,CHS,657,0,0,0,,你要干什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.55,0:51:33.45,CHS,658,0,0,0,,别怕  亲爱的  我是你的救星
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.55,0:51:38.01,CHS,659,0,0,0,,是我从这个绿...怪物手中救了你
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.73,0:51:43.06,CHS,660,0,0,0,,那是我的公主!去找你自己的!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.13,0:51:48.19,CHS,661,0,0,0,,怪物  你没看见我在忙吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.27,0:51:51.86,CHS,662,0,0,0,,伙计  你以为你自己是谁!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.94,0:51:54.53,CHS,663,0,0,0,,哦  当然!太冒昧了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.61,0:51:56.70,CHS,664,0,0,0,,请让我做个自我介绍
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.78,0:51:59.68,CHS,665,0,0,0,,哦  伙计们!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.82,0:52:07.91,CHS,666,0,0,0,,我劫富济贫
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.99,0:52:10.11,CHS,667,0,0,0,,- 他只拿了一小部分   - 我并不贪婪
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.19,0:52:12.21,CHS,668,0,0,0,,我救了美丽的公主  我是一个好人
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.29,0:52:15.26,CHS,669,0,0,0,,先生们  跳起来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.96,0:52:21.23,CHS,670,0,0,0,,我喜欢一场公平的决斗和一个可爱的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.30,0:52:23.56,CHS,671,0,0,0,,他想说的是他喜欢...自己应得的
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.64,0:52:26.23,CHS,672,0,0,0,,当一个怪物抓住了一位公主
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.30,0:52:28.60,CHS,673,0,0,0,,- 真糟糕   - 真糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.67,0:52:30.94,CHS,674,0,0,0,,当我想到美女与野兽一起  就使我恼怒
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.01,0:52:32.94,CHS,675,0,0,0,,他发怒了  他真的发怒了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.01,0:52:34.91,CHS,676,0,0,0,,我要将我的剑插入你的心脏
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.98,0:52:39.58,CHS,677,0,0,0,,看着我  因为我要开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.16,0:52:47.79,CHS,678,0,0,0,,这些家伙真烦人!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.86,0:52:49.62,CHS,679,0,0,0,,哦  你这个小...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.86,0:53:19.92,CHS,680,0,0,0,,呃  我们可以走了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.26,0:53:24.25,CHS,681,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.73,0:53:27.70,CHS,682,0,0,0,,哦  先等等
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.77,0:53:29.79,CHS,683,0,0,0,,- 你从哪里学来的?   - 什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.87,0:53:32.77,CHS,684,0,0,0,,那个!就是刚才那个  真令人惊奇!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.84,0:53:34.77,CHS,685,0,0,0,,你从哪里学来的?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.84,0:53:37.97,CHS,686,0,0,0,,一个人自己住的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.04,0:53:40.81,CHS,687,0,0,0,,就应该学一些东西来以防万一...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.88,0:53:43.51,CHS,688,0,0,0,,- 你屁股上有根箭!  - 什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.58,0:53:47.38,CHS,689,0,0,0,,- 哦  真的吗?  - 噢  不  这都是我不好
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.45,0:53:49.39,CHS,690,0,0,0,,- 对不起   - 为什么?怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.45,0:53:52.82,CHS,691,0,0,0,,- 史莱克受伤了 - 史莱克受伤了  他受伤了?哦  不  他要死了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.89,0:53:56.69,CHS,692,0,0,0,,- 小驴  我没事 - 你不能死  我还很小  你不能死
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.76,0:53:58.89,CHS,693,0,0,0,,把你的脚抬起来  转过你的头咳嗽
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.96,0:54:01.99,CHS,694,0,0,0,,- 有人会海姆利克疗法吗? - 镇静点  小驴
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.07,0:54:06.70,CHS,695,0,0,0,,如果你想救史莱克 快去森林里找一朵蓝色的花  花上有红色的刺
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.77,0:54:10.37,CHS,696,0,0,0,,蓝色的花  红色的刺 好的  我就去  蓝色的花  红色的刺
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.44,0:54:13.90,CHS,697,0,0,0,,不要死  史莱克 如果你看到一条长隧道  远离光线
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.98,0:54:17.14,CHS,698,0,0,0,,- 小驴!  - 好的  蓝色的花  红色的刺
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.25,0:54:19.55,CHS,699,0,0,0,,- 蓝色的花  红色的刺  - 那花儿有什么用?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.62,0:54:21.85,CHS,700,0,0,0,,- 是为了让驴走开  - 哦
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.92,0:54:24.32,CHS,701,0,0,0,,现在你先别动  我要把刺一下拔出来
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.39,0:54:26.58,CHS,702,0,0,0,,喔!轻点
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.66,0:54:29.32,CHS,703,0,0,0,,- 抱歉  但一定要拔出来  - 不  轻点儿
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.39,0:54:31.16,CHS,704,0,0,0,,现在  坚持住
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.23,0:54:33.32,CHS,705,0,0,0,,- 没什么用  - 别动
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.40,0:54:36.06,CHS,706,0,0,0,,- 停下  - 你能...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.13,0:54:40.59,CHS,707,0,0,0,,好的  你希望我怎么做?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.67,0:54:43.40,CHS,708,0,0,0,,蓝色的花  红色的刺 蓝色的花  红色的刺
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.48,0:54:45.88,CHS,709,0,0,0,,如果我不是色盲的话就容易多了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.94,0:54:48.04,CHS,710,0,0,0,,蓝色的花  红色的刺
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.11,0:54:50.51,CHS,711,0,0,0,,坚持住  史莱克!我来了!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.02,0:54:54.18,CHS,712,0,0,0,,太痛了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.25,0:54:56.78,CHS,713,0,0,0,,好的  好的  马上就好
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.86,0:54:59.48,CHS,714,0,0,0,,就要...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.03,0:55:07.43,CHS,715,0,0,0,,没什么  我们正准备...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.50,0:55:10.23,CHS,716,0,0,0,,如果你不希望有人打搅 只要说一声就可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.30,0:55:13.57,CHS,717,0,0,0,,哦  别傻了  这不是我想要的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.64,0:55:17.30,CHS,718,0,0,0,,公主正要...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.48,0:55:23.21,CHS,719,0,0,0,,嘿!那是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.28,0:55:26.11,CHS,720,0,0,0,,那是...血吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.40,0:55:46.06,CHS,721,0,0,0,,我的怪物爱人和我
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.34,0:55:51.83,CHS,722,0,0,0,,我们一起去任何地方
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.91,0:55:56.64,CHS,723,0,0,0,,一起穿一件有四条袖子的雨衣
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.72,0:56:01.35,CHS,724,0,0,0,,不管什么天气都一起渡过
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.42,0:56:06.69,CHS,725,0,0,0,,她永远是我的唯一
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.76,0:56:11.29,CHS,726,0,0,0,,是在我和糟糕的事情之间
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.36,0:56:16.43,CHS,727,0,0,0,,这是我生命的意义  这是一个严肃的话题
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.57,0:56:58.51,CHS,728,0,0,0,,就是这里  公主
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.58,0:57:00.94,CHS,729,0,0,0,,你的未来在等你
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.01,0:57:03.28,CHS,730,0,0,0,,- 那是杜洛克吗?  - 是的  我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.35,0:57:06.01,CHS,731,0,0,0,,你知道  史莱克认为弗瓜王在弥补什么
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.08,0:57:08.61,CHS,732,0,0,0,,我想说的是他有一个...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.69,0:57:10.62,CHS,733,0,0,0,,呃  我  呃...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.69,0:57:13.12,CHS,734,0,0,0,,- 我们还是上路吧  - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.19,0:57:15.28,CHS,735,0,0,0,,但是  史莱克?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.36,0:57:18.16,CHS,736,0,0,0,,我...  我很担心小驴
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.23,0:57:20.60,CHS,737,0,0,0,,- 什么?  - 我说  你看他
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.70,0:57:23.69,CHS,738,0,0,0,,- 他看起来不太好  - 你在说什么?我很好
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.77,0:57:28.80,CHS,739,0,0,0,,他们总是这么说  然后他们就倒下了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.87,0:57:31.34,CHS,740,0,0,0,,- 死去  - 你知道  她说的对
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.41,0:57:34.31,CHS,741,0,0,0,,你看起来气色不好  你想坐下休息一会吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.38,0:57:37.11,CHS,742,0,0,0,,- 给你弄杯茶  - 我原来不想说
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.18,0:57:39.95,CHS,743,0,0,0,,我的脖子很疼  而且我要是像这样转头  瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.02,0:57:41.45,CHS,744,0,0,0,,哦!看见了?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.52,0:57:44.58,CHS,745,0,0,0,,- 谁饿了吗?我要去找点吃的  - 我去捡柴火
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.69,0:57:49.18,CHS,746,0,0,0,,你去哪?伙计  我的脚趾没有知觉了!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.26,0:57:51.79,CHS,747,0,0,0,,我没有知觉了!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.86,0:57:54.20,CHS,748,0,0,0,,我需要一个拥抱
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.07,0:58:04.03,CHS,749,0,0,0,,嗯  很好吃  真的很好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.24,0:58:08.51,CHS,750,0,0,0,,- 这是什么?  - 田鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.58,0:58:10.71,CHS,751,0,0,0,,是烤的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.78,0:58:13.31,CHS,752,0,0,0,,别开玩笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.38,0:58:15.32,CHS,753,0,0,0,,真的  很美味
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.39,0:58:17.48,CHS,754,0,0,0,,炖着吃也很香
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.56,0:58:21.82,CHS,755,0,0,0,,我不是说大话  我弄的炖田鼠很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.50,0:58:29.66,CHS,756,0,0,0,,我想明天的晚餐应该会有点不同吧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.73,0:58:34.83,CHS,757,0,0,0,,以后你可以来沼泽看我
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.91,0:58:37.07,CHS,758,0,0,0,,我会给你做很多好吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.14,0:58:41.74,CHS,759,0,0,0,,沼泽蛤蟆汤  鱼眼油饼...你随便点
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.11,0:58:44.24,CHS,760,0,0,0,,我想我会喜欢的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.16,0:58:54.39,CHS,761,0,0,0,,去看埃及的金字塔
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.46,0:58:57.09,CHS,762,0,0,0,,呃  公主?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.16,0:59:01.43,CHS,763,0,0,0,,- 在岛上看日出  - 史莱克
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.50,0:59:05.37,CHS,764,0,0,0,,- 我  我想问...  - 记住每一个瞬间
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.44,0:59:07.70,CHS,765,0,0,0,,你...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.77,0:59:10.37,CHS,766,0,0,0,,你属于我
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.44,0:59:13.21,CHS,767,0,0,0,,你还吃吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.02,0:59:24.11,CHS,768,0,0,0,,- 伙计  很浪漫  不是吗?去看日落吧  - 日落?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.19,0:59:26.71,CHS,769,0,0,0,,哦  不!我的意思是  太晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.82,0:59:28.72,CHS,770,0,0,0,,- 我...太晚了  - 什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.79,0:59:31.73,CHS,771,0,0,0,,等一下  我明白是怎么回事了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.80,0:59:34.77,CHS,772,0,0,0,,- 你害怕黑夜  是吗?  - 是的!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.83,0:59:38.83,CHS,773,0,0,0,,是的  是这样  我害怕  我最好进去
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.90,0:59:42.27,CHS,774,0,0,0,,别怕  公主  我以前也怕黑  直到...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.34,0:59:45.10,CHS,775,0,0,0,,不  等等  我还是怕黑
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.18,0:59:47.74,CHS,776,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.41,0:59:49.67,CHS,777,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.69,0:59:57.45,CHS,778,0,0,0,,现在我明白发生了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.52,0:59:59.46,CHS,779,0,0,0,,你明白什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.52,1:00:02.29,CHS,780,0,0,0,,我什么也没有听见   但是我有动物的直觉
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.36,1:00:04.79,CHS,781,0,0,0,,我知道   你们互相都有好感  我能感觉的到
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.86,1:00:07.70,CHS,782,0,0,0,,你乱讲  我只是把她送到弗瓜王那儿
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.77,1:00:11.13,CHS,783,0,0,0,,拜托  史莱克  抓住机会
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.20,1:00:12.86,CHS,784,0,0,0,,去跟她表白吧
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.94,1:00:17.97,CHS,785,0,0,0,,没什么好说的  还有  即使我去跟她...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.04,1:00:19.94,CHS,786,0,0,0,,你知道...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.04,1:00:23.54,CHS,787,0,0,0,,我不会去的  因为...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.62,1:00:26.05,CHS,788,0,0,0,,她是一位公主  而我是...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.12,1:00:27.81,CHS,789,0,0,0,,一个怪物?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.89,1:00:31.55,CHS,790,0,0,0,,是的  一个怪物
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.62,1:00:35.68,CHS,791,0,0,0,,- 嘿  你去哪里?  - 去找些...柴火
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.95,1:00:56.64,CHS,792,0,0,0,,公主
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.71,1:00:59.41,CHS,793,0,0,0,,菲奥娜公主
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.66,1:01:06.52,CHS,794,0,0,0,,公主  你在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.76,1:01:14.25,CHS,795,0,0,0,,公主?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.34,1:01:20.10,CHS,796,0,0,0,,这里有点怪异  我可不是在玩游戏
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.32,1:01:32.75,CHS,797,0,0,0,,- 哦  不!  - 不  救命!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.82,1:01:35.91,CHS,798,0,0,0,,- 嘘! - 史莱克  史莱克  史莱克 - 不  没什么事了  没事了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.99,1:01:38.89,CHS,799,0,0,0,,- 公主在哪里?  - 小驴  我就是公主
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.96,1:01:41.72,CHS,800,0,0,0,,这是我的身体
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.79,1:01:44.35,CHS,801,0,0,0,,哦  我的上帝!你吃了公主
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.43,1:01:46.36,CHS,802,0,0,0,,- 你能听到我吗?  - 小驴
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.43,1:01:48.76,CHS,803,0,0,0,,- 听着  坚持住!我会把你弄出来的 - 不!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.83,1:01:51.30,CHS,804,0,0,0,,- 史莱克  史莱克  史莱克   - 嘘
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.37,1:01:53.23,CHS,805,0,0,0,,- 史莱克  - 是我
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.34,1:02:01.24,CHS,806,0,0,0,,公主?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.31,1:02:04.80,CHS,807,0,0,0,,发生什么事了?你怎么...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.88,1:02:06.82,CHS,808,0,0,0,,变样了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.88,1:02:09.15,CHS,809,0,0,0,,- 我变丑了  是吗?  - 哦  是的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.22,1:02:12.38,CHS,810,0,0,0,,是因为你吃的东西吗? 我告诉过史莱克吃老鼠不好
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.46,1:02:14.98,CHS,811,0,0,0,,- 我说是因为你吃的东西...  - 不
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.06,1:02:18.43,CHS,812,0,0,0,,我...我从记事起就这个样了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.50,1:02:20.96,CHS,813,0,0,0,,什么意思?我从未见过你这个样子
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.03,1:02:24.20,CHS,814,0,0,0,,只有日落后才会变成这样
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.64,1:02:29.23,CHS,815,0,0,0,,白天一个样  晚上一个样
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.34,1:02:31.40,CHS,816,0,0,0,,形成了规律
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.48,1:02:34.60,CHS,817,0,0,0,,只有得到真爱的初吻
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.68,1:02:39.12,CHS,818,0,0,0,,然后变成他的模样
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.18,1:02:42.74,CHS,819,0,0,0,,啊  真美  我还不知道你会写诗
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.82,1:02:44.75,CHS,820,0,0,0,,这是个诅咒
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.82,1:02:47.42,CHS,821,0,0,0,,我小的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.49,1:02:50.15,CHS,822,0,0,0,,一个巫婆诅咒了我
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.23,1:02:52.79,CHS,823,0,0,0,,每天晚上我就会变成这个样
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.86,1:02:56.53,CHS,824,0,0,0,,一个可怕而又丑陋的怪物
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.04,1:03:04.10,CHS,825,0,0,0,,我被困在城堡中  等待真爱来救我
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.18,1:03:06.74,CHS,826,0,0,0,,这就是为什么我必须在 明天日落前跟弗瓜王结婚
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.84,1:03:10.25,CHS,827,0,0,0,,在他见到我这样子以前
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.52,1:03:14.49,CHS,828,0,0,0,,像这样
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.55,1:03:17.82,CHS,829,0,0,0,,好的  冷静点  看  这不是很坏
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.89,1:03:22.05,CHS,830,0,0,0,,你不是很丑  我不会撒谎  你是丑
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.13,1:03:25.15,CHS,831,0,0,0,,但你只是夜晚丑  史莱克却时刻如此
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.23,1:03:28.63,CHS,832,0,0,0,,但是  小驴  我是一位公主
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.70,1:03:32.29,CHS,833,0,0,0,,这不是一位公主该有的长相
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.37,1:03:36.14,CHS,834,0,0,0,,公主  你不跟弗瓜王结婚怎么样?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.21,1:03:38.14,CHS,835,0,0,0,,我必须这样
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.21,1:03:41.04,CHS,836,0,0,0,,只有真爱的人的吻才能解除诅咒
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.11,1:03:44.67,CHS,837,0,0,0,,但是  你是一个善良的怪物
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.75,1:03:48.19,CHS,838,0,0,0,,而且  史莱克  你们有很多共同点
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.25,1:03:49.74,CHS,839,0,0,0,,史莱克?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.82,1:03:53.66,CHS,840,0,0,0,,公主  我...你好吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.76,1:03:56.56,CHS,841,0,0,0,,好?我很好
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.63,1:03:58.56,CHS,842,0,0,0,,我也很好
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.63,1:04:03.53,CHS,843,0,0,0,,我看到这些花想到你  因为花很漂亮...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.60,1:04:07.87,CHS,844,0,0,0,,我不怎么喜欢  但是我想你会喜欢   因为你很漂亮
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.94,1:04:11.17,CHS,845,0,0,0,,反正我很喜欢你  我...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.31,1:04:16.87,CHS,846,0,0,0,,对我来说很难  好的  走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.95,1:04:19.44,CHS,847,0,0,0,,我不能随便嫁人的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.52,1:04:21.82,CHS,848,0,0,0,,看着我  小驴
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.92,1:04:23.85,CHS,849,0,0,0,,我说的是真的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.92,1:04:26.58,CHS,850,0,0,0,,谁会爱上一个丑陋的怪物?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.66,1:04:29.09,CHS,851,0,0,0,,公主和丑八怪不能在一起
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.16,1:04:31.59,CHS,852,0,0,0,,这就是我不能跟史莱克在一起的原因
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.66,1:04:36.10,CHS,853,0,0,0,,我唯一的机会就是嫁给真爱的人
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.17,1:04:39.60,CHS,854,0,0,0,,你明白吗  小驴?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.67,1:04:42.97,CHS,855,0,0,0,,我必须这么做
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.04,1:04:46.10,CHS,856,0,0,0,,这是解除诅咒的唯一办法
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.18,1:04:48.94,CHS,857,0,0,0,,- 你至少应该告诉史莱克真相  - 不!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.01,1:04:51.95,CHS,858,0,0,0,,你一个字也不能说   没有人知道这个秘密
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.02,1:04:54.14,CHS,859,0,0,0,,如果要保密为什么要告诉我?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.22,1:04:57.38,CHS,860,0,0,0,,答应我保密  发誓
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.46,1:05:00.55,CHS,861,0,0,0,,好的  好的  我不会告诉他 但你可以告诉他
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.63,1:05:03.62,CHS,862,0,0,0,,在这些结束之前  我需要接受治疗
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.69,1:05:07.22,CHS,863,0,0,0,,瞧  我的眼睛在抽搐
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.92,1:05:33.69,CHS,864,0,0,0,,告诉他  不告诉他
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.06,1:05:38.15,CHS,865,0,0,0,,告诉他  不告诉他
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.23,1:05:40.16,CHS,866,0,0,0,,告诉他
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.23,1:05:42.32,CHS,867,0,0,0,,史莱克!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.40,1:05:44.96,CHS,868,0,0,0,,史莱克  有些事  我想...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.76,1:06:07.95,CHS,869,0,0,0,,史莱克
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.39,1:06:11.45,CHS,870,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗?  - 我很好!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.53,1:06:13.50,CHS,871,0,0,0,,好的不得了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.56,1:06:16.86,CHS,872,0,0,0,,我...我不...我有些事情要告诉你
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.93,1:06:19.49,CHS,873,0,0,0,,你不必告诉我任何事情  公主
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.57,1:06:21.66,CHS,874,0,0,0,,- 我昨晚听够了 - 什么  你听见我说的话了?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.74,1:06:23.67,CHS,875,0,0,0,,每一句
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.74,1:06:25.90,CHS,876,0,0,0,,我想你能理解
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.98,1:06:27.91,CHS,877,0,0,0,,我理解
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.98,1:06:31.57,CHS,878,0,0,0,,就像你说的  谁会爱上一个丑陋的怪物?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.65,1:06:34.35,CHS,879,0,0,0,,但我以为这对你来说无所谓
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.42,1:06:36.18,CHS,880,0,0,0,,是吗?无所谓
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.76,1:06:40.99,CHS,881,0,0,0,,啊  真准时
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.06,1:06:43.93,CHS,882,0,0,0,,公主  我给你带来个小东西
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.33,1:06:52.00,CHS,883,0,0,0,,我错过了什么吗?我错过了什么吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.10,1:06:54.73,CHS,884,0,0,0,,是谁说的?不可能是驴
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.11,1:06:58.58,CHS,885,0,0,0,,菲奥娜公主
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.64,1:07:01.34,CHS,886,0,0,0,,完成你的承诺
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.45,1:07:05.71,CHS,887,0,0,0,,好的  怪物  你的沼泽地的契约
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.78,1:07:10.35,CHS,888,0,0,0,,在我改变主意之前拿走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.42,1:07:13.25,CHS,889,0,0,0,,原谅我  公主  让你吃惊了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.32,1:07:15.26,CHS,890,0,0,0,,但是你也让我吃惊了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.33,1:07:19.02,CHS,891,0,0,0,,我从没有见过这样的美人
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.10,1:07:22.09,CHS,892,0,0,0,,我是弗瓜王
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.17,1:07:26.07,CHS,893,0,0,0,,弗瓜王?哦  不  不
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.14,1:07:29.11,CHS,894,0,0,0,,请原谅我  我正要...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.17,1:07:34.63,CHS,895,0,0,0,,告别
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.71,1:07:39.38,CHS,896,0,0,0,,真善良  你不必对那个怪物那么客气
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.45,1:07:41.38,CHS,897,0,0,0,,它没有感情
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.45,1:07:45.41,CHS,898,0,0,0,,你是对的  它没有
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.49,1:07:49.48,CHS,899,0,0,0,,菲奥娜公主  美丽  完美无暇的公主
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.56,1:07:52.59,CHS,900,0,0,0,,我向你求婚
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.66,1:07:57.69,CHS,901,0,0,0,,你愿意成为完美新郎的完美新娘吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.01,1:08:06.17,CHS,902,0,0,0,,弗瓜王  我愿意  没有什么...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.24,1:08:09.44,CHS,903,0,0,0,,太好了  我决定  我们明天就举行婚礼!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.51,1:08:11.45,CHS,904,0,0,0,,不  我是说...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.52,1:08:13.92,CHS,905,0,0,0,,为什么要等明天?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.98,1:08:17.82,CHS,906,0,0,0,,让我们在今天日落以前就结婚
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.89,1:08:20.58,CHS,907,0,0,0,,哦  着急了  是吧?你说的对
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.69,1:08:24.63,CHS,908,0,0,0,,越快越好  有很多事情要做
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.70,1:08:27.03,CHS,909,0,0,0,,宴会  蛋糕  乐队  客人名单
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.10,1:08:30.12,CHS,910,0,0,0,,队长  快去请客人!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.20,1:08:32.93,CHS,911,0,0,0,,再见了  怪物
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.00,1:08:35.60,CHS,912,0,0,0,,史莱克  你在干什么?你就这样让她走了?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.67,1:08:38.37,CHS,913,0,0,0,,- 是吗?那又怎么样? - 史莱克  有些事你应该知道
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.44,1:08:40.88,CHS,914,0,0,0,,我昨晚跟她谈话  她是...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.95,1:08:45.01,CHS,915,0,0,0,,我知道你跟她昨晚谈话   你们是好朋友  不是吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.08,1:08:48.85,CHS,916,0,0,0,,你俩那么好  你为什么不跟着她走?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.92,1:08:50.89,CHS,917,0,0,0,,史莱克  我想跟着你
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.96,1:08:53.95,CHS,918,0,0,0,,我没告诉过你吗?你不能跟我回家
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.02,1:08:57.98,CHS,919,0,0,0,,我单独生活!我的沼泽!我!没有别人!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.06,1:09:00.16,CHS,920,0,0,0,,明白吗?没有别人!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.23,1:09:05.07,CHS,921,0,0,0,,特别是无用的  可怜的  烦人的会说话的驴
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.14,1:09:08.33,CHS,922,0,0,0,,- 但是  我想...  - 你知道什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.41,1:09:10.60,CHS,923,0,0,0,,你的想法错了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.38,1:09:14.28,CHS,924,0,0,0,,史莱克
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.75,1:11:36.78,CHS,925,0,0,0,,小驴?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.85,1:11:39.05,CHS,926,0,0,0,,你在干什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.12,1:11:42.12,CHS,927,0,0,0,,我想  对每一个人  你要学会认识墙
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.19,1:11:44.13,CHS,928,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.19,1:11:47.56,CHS,929,0,0,0,,但是墙应该围绕着我的沼泽  而不是穿过
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.63,1:11:50.46,CHS,930,0,0,0,,是这样的  这是你的一半  那是我的一半
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.53,1:11:53.13,CHS,931,0,0,0,,哦  你的一半
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.20,1:11:55.73,CHS,932,0,0,0,,对  我的一半  我帮你救了公主
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.81,1:11:58.07,CHS,933,0,0,0,,我做了一半的工作  我应该得到一半的奖品
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.14,1:12:01.51,CHS,934,0,0,0,,现在把那个大石头给我   就是像你脑袋的那个
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.58,1:12:03.91,CHS,935,0,0,0,,- 退后!  - 不  你退后
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.98,1:12:06.01,CHS,936,0,0,0,,- 这是我的沼泽  - 我的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.08,1:12:08.02,CHS,937,0,0,0,,- 放开  小驴!  - 不  你放开
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.09,1:12:10.05,CHS,938,0,0,0,,- 顽固的驴!  - 臭怪物!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.12,1:12:12.35,CHS,939,0,0,0,,好吧!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.42,1:12:15.76,CHS,940,0,0,0,,- 回来  我还没有说完 - 但是我已经跟你说完了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.83,1:12:19.09,CHS,941,0,0,0,,跟你在一起  你总是"我  我  我"
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.16,1:12:21.76,CHS,942,0,0,0,,猜猜看!该我了!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.83,1:12:23.99,CHS,943,0,0,0,,闭嘴  听我说!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.07,1:12:26.04,CHS,944,0,0,0,,你对我总是很刻薄
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.10,1:12:28.59,CHS,945,0,0,0,,你侮辱我而且你不感激我做的每件事
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.67,1:12:31.77,CHS,946,0,0,0,,你总是把我呼来喝去
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.84,1:12:35.71,CHS,947,0,0,0,,是吗   如果我对你这么不好  为什么你还要回来?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.78,1:12:39.01,CHS,948,0,0,0,,因为我们是朋友  朋友会原谅彼此的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.08,1:12:42.28,CHS,949,0,0,0,,哦  你说的对  小驴
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.35,1:12:46.59,CHS,950,0,0,0,,我原谅你背叛了我
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.66,1:12:52.10,CHS,951,0,0,0,,你把自己裹在层里  洋葱仔  你害怕你自己的感觉
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.16,1:12:55.62,CHS,952,0,0,0,,- 走开!  - 你又那么做了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.70,1:12:58.29,CHS,953,0,0,0,,就像对公主一样  她喜欢你  甚至爱上你
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.37,1:13:02.53,CHS,954,0,0,0,,爱上我?她说我是一个丑陋可怕的怪物
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.61,1:13:04.54,CHS,955,0,0,0,,我听见你们俩的谈话了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.61,1:13:06.54,CHS,956,0,0,0,,她不是说你
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.61,1:13:08.94,CHS,957,0,0,0,,她是在说...别人
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.48,1:13:13.92,CHS,958,0,0,0,,她不是说我?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.98,1:13:16.28,CHS,959,0,0,0,,那她说的是谁?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.35,1:13:19.08,CHS,960,0,0,0,,我什么都不说  反正你也没有兴趣听
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.16,1:13:21.45,CHS,961,0,0,0,,- 是吗?是吗?  - 小驴!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.53,1:13:22.25,CHS,962,0,0,0,,不!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.16,1:13:26.06,CHS,963,0,0,0,,好  我道歉  好吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.57,1:13:34.60,CHS,964,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.67,1:13:38.90,CHS,965,0,0,0,,我是一个愚蠢而又丑陋的怪物
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.14,1:13:42.08,CHS,966,0,0,0,,你能原谅我吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.31,1:13:46.25,CHS,967,0,0,0,,朋友就是这样的嘛  对吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.32,1:13:48.98,CHS,968,0,0,0,,正确  朋友?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.05,1:13:50.99,CHS,969,0,0,0,,朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.06,1:13:54.02,CHS,970,0,0,0,,那么...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.09,1:13:56.36,CHS,971,0,0,0,,公主是怎么说我的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.43,1:13:59.59,CHS,972,0,0,0,,为什么问我?你应该去问她
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.66,1:14:02.66,CHS,973,0,0,0,,婚礼!我们来不及了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.73,1:14:06.46,CHS,974,0,0,0,,别急  有志者事竟成
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.54,1:14:08.16,CHS,975,0,0,0,,我有办法
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.54,1:14:13.71,CHS,976,0,0,0,,小驴
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.08,1:14:17.48,CHS,977,0,0,0,,我想这是我个人的魅力
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.55,1:14:20.71,CHS,978,0,0,0,,你  过来
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.78,1:14:23.62,CHS,979,0,0,0,,别这样  没人喜欢拍驴屁的
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.69,1:14:26.21,CHS,980,0,0,0,,好  上来  抓紧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.29,1:14:29.78,CHS,981,0,0,0,,我还没来得及装安全带呢
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.46,1:15:04.02,CHS,982,0,0,0,,杜洛克的公民们
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.09,1:15:06.76,CHS,983,0,0,0,,我们今天到这来
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.83,1:15:08.89,CHS,984,0,0,0,,来见证...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.97,1:15:10.90,CHS,985,0,0,0,,结合...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.97,1:15:13.44,CHS,986,0,0,0,,- 为我们的新国王   - 打扰一下
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.50,1:15:16.20,CHS,987,0,0,0,,我们能不能直接跳到"我愿意"?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.27,1:15:18.17,CHS,988,0,0,0,,继续
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.25,1:15:26.84,CHS,989,0,0,0,,走找点乐子  需要你时我会吹口哨的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.49,1:15:31.42,CHS,990,0,0,0,,史莱克  等等  等等!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.49,1:15:34.18,CHS,991,0,0,0,,- 你要那么做  是吗?  - 你在说什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.26,1:15:36.19,CHS,992,0,0,0,,你必须等一句台词
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.26,1:15:38.75,CHS,993,0,0,0,,等待牧师说  现在说否则永远保持沉默
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.83,1:15:42.60,CHS,994,0,0,0,,- 这时你说  我反对   - 我没有时间听这些
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.67,1:15:44.40,CHS,995,0,0,0,,等等  你听我说
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.47,1:15:46.40,CHS,996,0,0,0,,- 你爱那个女人吗?  - 是的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.47,1:15:47.77,CHS,997,0,0,0,,- 你想牵她的手  对吗?  - 是的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.84,1:15:49.60,CHS,998,0,0,0,,- 让她高兴?  - 是的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.64,1:15:52.77,CHS,999,0,0,0,,那你就要去...去...试着温柔点
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.84,1:15:55.61,CHS,1000,0,0,0,,- 女人都喜欢这种浪漫的废话! - 是的  完全正确
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.68,1:15:59.31,CHS,1001,0,0,0,,- 那家伙什么时候说这个? - 我们得查一下
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.38,1:16:02.55,CHS,1002,0,0,0,,以我的权力
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.65,1:16:05.92,CHS,1003,0,0,0,,- 你看见什么了?  - 全城的人都在
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.99,1:16:09.12,CHS,1004,0,0,0,,- 我宣布你们为夫妻  - 他们在祭坛上
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.19,1:16:11.75,CHS,1005,0,0,0,,- 国王和王后  - 他已经说了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.83,1:16:14.46,CHS,1006,0,0,0,,看在圣彼得的面上
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.70,1:16:17.76,CHS,1007,0,0,0,,我反对!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.83,1:16:19.93,CHS,1008,0,0,0,,史莱克?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.00,1:16:21.94,CHS,1009,0,0,0,,他想干什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.51,1:16:28.57,CHS,1010,0,0,0,,各位  过得很愉快  是吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.65,1:16:30.84,CHS,1011,0,0,0,,首先我很喜欢杜洛克
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.91,1:16:33.44,CHS,1012,0,0,0,,- 很干净  - 你来这里干什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.52,1:16:36.45,CHS,1013,0,0,0,,没有人欢迎你来
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.52,1:16:39.85,CHS,1014,0,0,0,,- 你不请自来太无礼了   - 菲奥纳
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.92,1:16:42.95,CHS,1015,0,0,0,,- 我想跟你谈谈  - 你想说什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.03,1:16:46.00,CHS,1016,0,0,0,,现在说有点晚了  但如果你能原谅我...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.06,1:16:48.43,CHS,1017,0,0,0,,- 你不能嫁给他  - 为什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.53,1:16:52.43,CHS,1018,0,0,0,,因为...因为他娶你只是为了能当上国王
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.50,1:16:54.87,CHS,1019,0,0,0,,可恶!菲奥纳  别听他的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.94,1:16:58.60,CHS,1020,0,0,0,,- 他不是你的真爱  - 你懂什么是真爱吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.68,1:17:01.04,CHS,1021,0,0,0,,嗯  我  我...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.11,1:17:04.51,CHS,1022,0,0,0,,- 我是说...   - 真有意思
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.88,1:17:09.25,CHS,1023,0,0,0,,这个怪物爱上了公主!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.35,1:17:11.62,CHS,1024,0,0,0,,哦  上帝啊
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.69,1:17:13.62,CHS,1025,0,0,0,,一个怪物和一个公主
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.23,1:17:21.72,CHS,1026,0,0,0,,史莱克  这是真的吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.73,1:17:25.69,CHS,1027,0,0,0,,谁关心呢?真荒谬!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.77,1:17:29.40,CHS,1028,0,0,0,,菲奥纳  我的爱人   吻完我们就能得到永远的幸福
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.47,1:17:31.07,CHS,1029,0,0,0,,吻我!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.15,1:17:39.48,CHS,1030,0,0,0,,白天一个样  晚上一个样
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.42,1:17:44.15,CHS,1031,0,0,0,,我想给你看我晚上的样子
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.35,1:18:11.37,CHS,1032,0,0,0,,我明白了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.95,1:18:15.11,CHS,1033,0,0,0,,真恶心
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.19,1:18:17.24,CHS,1034,0,0,0,,卫兵  卫兵
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.32,1:18:20.52,CHS,1035,0,0,0,,我命令你们把他们赶走
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.59,1:18:23.39,CHS,1036,0,0,0,,- 把他们俩都赶走  - 不  不
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.46,1:18:27.23,CHS,1037,0,0,0,,这不会改变任何事情   这婚姻仍然有效  我成为了国王
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.30,1:18:29.60,CHS,1038,0,0,0,,- 瞧  瞧  - 不  放开我  史莱克!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.67,1:18:31.40,CHS,1039,0,0,0,,不!别光站在那里  一群笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.47,1:18:33.99,CHS,1040,0,0,0,,滚开!菲奥纳!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.28,1:18:42.27,CHS,1041,0,0,0,,我要让你后悔和我见面   我要让你受尽折磨
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.35,1:18:45.28,CHS,1042,0,0,0,,- 到时候你会求我杀了你  - 不  史莱克!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.35,1:18:48.88,CHS,1043,0,0,0,,- 至于你  我的妻子  - 菲奥纳!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.95,1:18:51.61,CHS,1044,0,0,0,,我会把你锁到城堡里渡过你的余生
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.69,1:18:53.52,CHS,1045,0,0,0,,我是国王
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.62,1:18:57.39,CHS,1046,0,0,0,,我有权力  我至高无上  我将有...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.83,1:19:04.60,CHS,1047,0,0,0,,- 好  - 大家都别动
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.67,1:19:06.76,CHS,1048,0,0,0,,我有一条龙  而且会毫不犹豫的使用
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.84,1:19:10.07,CHS,1049,0,0,0,,我是头发怒的驴
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.14,1:19:16.58,CHS,1050,0,0,0,,名人的婚姻都没有长久的  对吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.72,1:19:20.55,CHS,1051,0,0,0,,去吧  史莱克
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.92,1:19:24.22,CHS,1052,0,0,0,,呃  菲奥纳
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.36,1:19:27.59,CHS,1053,0,0,0,,是的  史莱克
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.66,1:19:31.68,CHS,1054,0,0,0,,我...我爱你
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.76,1:19:34.03,CHS,1055,0,0,0,,真的吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.10,1:19:38.12,CHS,1056,0,0,0,,真的  真的
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.20,1:19:40.10,CHS,1057,0,0,0,,我也爱你
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.18,1:19:52.44,CHS,1058,0,0,0,,直到你找到真爱并得到他的吻
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.52,1:19:55.78,CHS,1059,0,0,0,,然后变成他的模样
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.38,1:20:22.28,CHS,1060,0,0,0,,变成他的模样  变成他的模样
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.45,1:20:30.94,CHS,1061,0,0,0,,菲奥纳
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.46,1:20:36.05,CHS,1062,0,0,0,,菲奥纳
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.13,1:20:38.69,CHS,1063,0,0,0,,你还好吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.76,1:20:40.70,CHS,1064,0,0,0,,是的  很好
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.76,1:20:44.03,CHS,1065,0,0,0,,但我不明白
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.10,1:20:46.23,CHS,1066,0,0,0,,我想应该变美的
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.94,1:20:51.20,CHS,1067,0,0,0,,你很漂亮
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.81,1:20:56.18,CHS,1068,0,0,0,,我希望是一个幸福的结局
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.02,1:21:04.45,CHS,1069,0,0,0,,我想爱情是童话故事中唯一真实的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.06,1:21:09.79,CHS,1070,0,0,0,,对别人有意义  但是对我没有
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.20,1:21:15.16,CHS,1071,0,0,0,,爱情不会光顾我
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.23,1:21:18.07,CHS,1072,0,0,0,,好像一直是这样
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.13,1:21:22.59,CHS,1073,0,0,0,,失望袭击着我的梦想
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.67,1:21:25.97,CHS,1074,0,0,0,,但是当我看到她的脸
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.04,1:21:28.84,CHS,1075,0,0,0,,现在我是一个信徒
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.91,1:21:34.38,CHS,1076,0,0,0,,不再怀疑是个踪迹
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.38,1:21:38.45,CHS,1077,0,0,0,,我恋爱了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.52,1:21:40.99,CHS,1078,0,0,0,,我是一个信徒  我离不开她
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.06,1:21:43.29,CHS,1079,0,0,0,,如果我试了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.36,1:21:47.42,CHS,1080,0,0,0,,神会保佑我们每一个人
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.50,1:21:51.02,CHS,1081,0,0,0,,- 一起来吧  - 当我看见她的脸
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.10,1:21:54.26,CHS,1082,0,0,0,,现在我是一个信徒
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.34,1:21:57.10,CHS,1083,0,0,0,,不是踪迹
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.21,1:22:00.01,CHS,1084,0,0,0,,从不怀疑
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.08,1:22:03.34,CHS,1085,0,0,0,,我恋爱了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.41,1:22:07.68,CHS,1086,0,0,0,,我是个信徒
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.69,1:22:13.28,CHS,1087,0,0,0,,当我看见她的脸
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.36,1:22:16.33,CHS,1088,0,0,0,,我是一个信徒
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.39,1:22:19.19,CHS,1089,0,0,0,,不是踪迹
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.26,1:22:22.53,CHS,1090,0,0,0,,从不怀疑  再来一次
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.60,1:22:27.16,CHS,1091,0,0,0,,我恋爱了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.24,1:22:29.10,CHS,1092,0,0,0,,大家一起来
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.17,1:22:31.11,CHS,1093,0,0,0,,我相信  我相信  我相信  我相信
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.17,1:22:33.84,CHS,1094,0,0,0,,我相信  我相信  我相信  我相信  我相信
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.91,1:22:36.50,CHS,1095,0,0,0,,跟我一起唱
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.58,1:22:38.28,CHS,1096,0,0,0,,我相信
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.35,1:22:41.32,CHS,1097,0,0,0,,我相信
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.38,1:22:44.32,CHS,1098,0,0,0,,我相信
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.39,1:22:47.36,CHS,1099,0,0,0,,我相信
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.42,1:22:50.33,CHS,1100,0,0,0,,我相信
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.39,1:22:54.83,CHS,1101,0,0,0,,我相信
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.23,1:22:59.50,CHS,1102,0,0,0,,哦  真有趣
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.57,1:23:02.13,CHS,1103,0,0,0,,我不能呼吸  我不能呼吸了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.11,1:23:05.40,CHS,1104,0,0,0,,我相信自我感觉
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.48,1:23:07.67,CHS,1105,0,0,0,,命运有时会改变
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.74,1:23:12.04,CHS,1106,0,0,0,,现在好像青睐我了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.12,1:23:14.24,CHS,1107,0,0,0,,我是一个丑八怪  一个怪物
